<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 TEKWARO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk mukwongo me Tekwaro</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tekwaro</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tek</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk mukwongo me</para>
  <para style="mt1">TEKWARO</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk me Tekwaro me acel ki me aryo nwoyo tito kore ki kore gin ma obedo katime ma kicoyo i buk pa Camuel ki i buk pa Luker, ento dok tito ki i yo mapat. Jami aryo ma dongo kati kamaleng ma kwako tekwaro pa Luker pa jo Icrael ki kit ma kicoyo kwede i buk me Tekwaro.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Me acel nyutu ni kadi bed peko mapol opoto ikom ker me Icrael ki Juda, ento Lubanga pud omede ki gwoko kwong ma mere bot jo Icrael kun cobo tame ki kit tic ducu ma en bitiyo ki jo ma gibedo i Juda. Wek ocob yub pa Lubanga, lacoc oneno matut gin mabeco ma Daudi ki solomon gutiyo ki bene kare me alokaloka mabeco ma obedo ikare pa luker macalo Yekocapat, Kejekia ki Yocia kacel ki jo ma gucung matek ikom Lubanga pi niyegi.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Me aryo buk man tito kore ki kore acaki me woro Lubanga i Ot pa Lubanga i Jerucalem kun neno tutwale tic pa Ajwaki pa Lubanga ki Lulevi ma gin aye yubu dok telo lega me woro ducu mapatpat. Daudi tye ki nyutu macalo dano ma ocako teguti me Ot pa Lubanga ki woro ducu matye iye, kadi bed Solomon aye ogedo Ot pa Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Tekwaro ki nying dano ma ki ryeyo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 1:1-9:44">1:1—9:44</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">To pa Caulo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 10:1-14">10:1-14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Loc pa Daudi <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 11:1-29:30">11:1—29:30</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Ayelayela ki gin ma Daudi otimo maber <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 11:1-22:1">11:1—22:1</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Yube me gedo Ot pa Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CH 22:2-29:30">22:2—29:30</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Adam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 5:1-32">Aca 5:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 10:1-32">10:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 11:10-26">11:10-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1" />Adam onywalo Ceji, Ceji onywalo Enoci, Enoci onywalo Kenan; <verse eid="1CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2" />Kenan onywalo Maalalel, Maalalel onywalo Jared. <verse eid="1CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3" />Jared onywalo Enoka, Enoka onywalo Metucela, Metucela onywalo Lamek. <verse eid="1CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4" />Lamek onywalo Nua, Nua onywalo Cem, Kam ki Yafeci.<verse eid="1CH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5" />Lutino awobe pa Yafeci aye Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Mecek ki Tirac. <verse eid="1CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6" />Lutino awobe pa Gomer aye Acikenaj, Ripat ki Togarma. <verse eid="1CH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7" />Lutino awobe pa Javan gin aye Elica, Tarcic, Kitim ki Dodanim.<verse eid="1CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8" />Lutino awobe pa Kam gin aye Kuc, Ejipt, Put ki Kanaan. <verse eid="1CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9" />Lutino awobe pa Kuc aye Seba, Kavila, Cabta, Raama ki Cabteka, Lutino awobe pa Raama gin aye Ceba ki Dedan. <verse eid="1CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10" />Kuc onywalo mere Nimurod; en aye okwongo bedo oteka iwi lobo.<verse eid="1CH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11" />Likwayo pa Ejipt gin aye jo Lud, jo Anam, jo Leab, jo Naptuk, <verse eid="1CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12" />jo Patruc, jo Kacluk ki jo Kaptor, ma gin aye kaka ma jo Piliciti gua ki ikomgi.<verse eid="1CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13" />Kanaan onywalo Cidon, latin kayone, ki Ket ma likwaye kilwongo ni jo Kit. <verse eid="1CH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14" />Likwayo mukene pa Kanaan gin aye jo Jebuc, jo Amor, jo Girgac, <verse eid="1CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15" />jo Kiv, jo Arki, jo Cin, <verse eid="1CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16" />jo Arvad, jo Jemar ki jo Kamat.<verse eid="1CH 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17" />Lutino awobe pa Cem gin aye Elam, Acur, Arpakcad, Lud, Aram, Uj, Kul, Geter ki Mecek. <verse eid="1CH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18" />Arpakcad onywalo Cela, Cela onywalo Eber, <verse eid="1CH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19" />Eber onywalo lutino awobe aryo; acel nyinge Peleg, pien ikarene aye kipoko iye lobo, ki nying omine onongo Yokotan. <verse eid="1CH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20" />Yokotan onywalo Almodad, Celep, Kajarmavet, Jera, <verse eid="1CH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21" />Adoram, Ujal, Dikla, <verse eid="1CH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22" />Obal, Abimael, Ceba, <verse eid="1CH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23" />Opir, Kavila ki Jobab; magi ducu gin lutino awobe pa Yokotan.<verse eid="1CH 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24" />Cem onywalo Arkpacad, Arpakcad onywalo Cela, Cela onywalo Eber, <verse eid="1CH 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25" />Eber onywalo Peleg, Peleg onywalo Reu, Reu onywalo Cerug, <verse eid="1CH 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26" />Cerug onywalo Nakor, Nakor onywalo Tera, <verse eid="1CH 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27" />Tera onywalo Abram (ma en aye Abraim).<verse eid="1CH 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Icmael ki pa Ketura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 25:12-16">Aca 25:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28" />Lutino awobe pa Abraim gin aye Icaka ki Icmael. <verse eid="1CH 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29" />Lutino pa Icmael gin ene: Nebaiot ma latin kayone, ki Kedar, Adbeel, Mibcam, <verse eid="1CH 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30" />Micima, Duma, Maca, Adad, Tema, <verse eid="1CH 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31" />Jetur, Napic ki Kedema. Jo magi ducu aye lutino awobe pa Icmael.<verse eid="1CH 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32" />Lutino awobe pa Ketura ma obedo dako pa Abraim ma angecaneni gin ene: Ketura onywalo Jimran, Yokocan, Medan, Midian, Icibak ki Cua. Lutino awobe pa Yokocan gin aye Ceba ki Dedan. <verse eid="1CH 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33" />Lutino awobe pa Midian gin aye Epa, Eper, Kanok, Abida ki Eldaa. Magi ducu aye likwayo pa Ketura.<verse eid="1CH 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Ecau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:1-19">Aca 36:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34" />Abraim onywalo Icaka. Lutino awobe pa Icaka gin aye Ecau ki Icrael. <verse eid="1CH 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35" />Lutino awobe pa Ecau aye Erifaji, Reuel, Jeuc, Jalam ki Kora. <verse eid="1CH 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36" />Lutino awobe pa Erifaji aye Teman, Omar, Jepi, Gatam, Kenaj, Timna ki Amalek. <verse eid="1CH 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37" />Lutino awobe pa Reuel gin Nakat, Jera, Camma ki Mija.<verse eid="1CH 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jo ma gukwongo bedo i lobo Edom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:20-30">Aca 36:20-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38" />Jo mayam gukwongo bedo i lobo Edom aye gin likwayo pa Ceir. Nyingi ene: Lotan, Cobal, Jibeon, Anga, Dicon, Ejer ki Dican. <verse eid="1CH 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39" />Lutino awobe pa Lotan aye Kori ki Komam. (Lamin Lotan obedo Timna). <verse eid="1CH 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40" />Lutino awobe pa Cobal gin aye Alian, Manakat, Ebal, Cepi ki Onam. Lutino awobe pa Jibeon aye Aiya ki Ana. <verse eid="1CH 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41" />Awobi pa Ana aye Dicon. Lutino awobe pa Dicon aye Kamram, Eciban, Itran ki Keran. <verse eid="1CH 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42" />Lutino awobe pa Ejer aye Bilan, Jaavan ki Jaakan. Lutino awobe pa Dican aye Uj ki Aran.<verse eid="1CH 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luker me Edom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:31-43">Aca 36:31-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43" />Magi aye luker ma guloyo lobo Edom ma onongo pud peya rwot mo oloyo jo Icrael: Bela wod pa Beor ma nying gang kale Dinkaba. <verse eid="1CH 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44" />Ka Bela oto, ci Jobab wod pa Jera me Bojra oleyo katyene. <verse eid="1CH 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45" />Ka Jobab oto, ci Kucam ma oa ki i lobo pa jo Teman oleyo katyene. <verse eid="1CH 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46" />Ka Kucam oto, ci Adad wod pa Bedad oleyo katyene. En aye yam olwenyo ki jo Midian, ci oloyogi i lobo Moab; nying gang kale aye Avit. <verse eid="1CH 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47" />Ka Adad oto, ci Camla me Macireka oleyo katyene. <verse eid="1CH 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48" />Ka Camla oto, Caul me Rekobot matye i dog kulu Euprate oleyo katyene. <verse eid="1CH 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49" />Ka Caul oto, ci Baal-kanan wod pa Akbor oleyo katyene. <verse eid="1CH 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50" />Ka Baal-kanan oto, ci Adad oleyo katyene; nying gang kale Pai. Nying dakone Meketabel nya pa Matred, ma nya pa Mejakab. <verse eid="1CH 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51" />Lacen Adad oto woko. Inge to pa Adad, ludito wi kaka ma oloyo Edom gin ene: Timna, Alia, Jetet, <verse eid="1CH 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52" />Okolibama, Ela, Pinon, <verse eid="1CH 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53" />Kenaj, Teman, Mibjar, <verse eid="1CH 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54" />Magdiel ki Iram. Magi aye rwodi ki ludito wi kaka ma i Edom.<verse eid="1CH 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lutino awobe pa Icrael</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 35:22-26">Aca 35:22-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1" />Magi aye lutino awobe pa Icrael: Reuben, Cimeon, Levi, Juda, Icakar, Jabulon, <verse eid="1CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2" />Dan, Yucepu, Benjamin, Naputali, Gad ki Acer.<verse eid="1CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3" />Lutino awobe pa Juda gin aye Er, Onan ki Cela. Lutino co adek magi, Bat-cua ma nya jo Kanaan aye onywalogi. Er ma en aye latin kayo pa Juda obedo dano marac iwang Rwot, ma omiyo Rwot oneke woko. <verse eid="1CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4" />Juda onywal ki ciwode Tamar lutino co aryo, Perej ki Jera. Lutino awobe pa Juda gin ducu obedo abic.<verse eid="1CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5" />Lutino awobe pa Perej gin aye Kejeron ki Kamul. <verse eid="1CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6" />Lutino awobe pa Jera aye Jimri, Etan, Eman, Kalkol ki Dara, gin ducu abic. <verse eid="1CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1">Yoc 7:1</ref></char></note>Latin awobi pa Karmi en aye Akan mayam layel jo Icrael, pi kano jami ma dong kidyero woko bot Rwot. <verse eid="1CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8" />Wod pa Etan obedo Ajaria.<verse eid="1CH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9" />Lutino awobe pa Kejeron ma en onywalo gin aye Jeramel, Ram ki Kelubai. <verse eid="1CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10" />Ram onywalo Aminadab, Aminadab onywalo Calma, <verse eid="1CH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11" />Calma onywalo Boaj, <verse eid="1CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12" />Boaj onywalo Obed, Obed onywalo Yece, <verse eid="1CH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13" />Yece onywalo Eliab ma latin kayone, me aryone Abinadab, me adeke Cimea, <verse eid="1CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14" />me angwene Netanel, me abice Radai, <verse eid="1CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15" />me abicele Ojem, me abirone Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16" />Lumegigi gin aye Jeruya ki Abigail. Jeruya obedo ki awobe adek gin aye Abicai, Joab ki Acael. <verse eid="1CH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17" />Abigail onywalo Amaca; won Amaca obedo Jeter ma jo Icmael.<verse eid="1CH 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18" />Kaleb wod pa Kejeron onywalo Jeriot ki dakone Ajuba. Lutino awobe pa Ajuba gin aye Jecer, Cobab ki Ardon. <verse eid="1CH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19" />Ka Ajuba oto, Kaleb onyomo Eprat ma onywalo Kur. <verse eid="1CH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20" />Kur onywalo Uri, Uri onywalo Bejalel.<verse eid="1CH 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21" />Lacen Kejeron obedo ki nya pa Makir ma won Gilead. En onyomo ma onongo mwaka me dite romo pyere abicel. Ci dako meno onywalo Cegub. <verse eid="1CH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22" />Cegub onywalo Jair mayam loyo taun madito pyere aryo wiye adek i lobo Gilead. <verse eid="1CH 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23" />Ento jo Gecur ki jo Aram gumayo taun me Jair ki bot wegine, kacel ki Kenat ki taun matinotino ma ingete, taun ducu pyere abicel. Jo magi ducu gin likwayo pa Makir ma won Gilead. <verse eid="1CH 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24" />Ka Kejeron dong oto, ci Kaleb obedo ki Eprata ma ciwone dako pa Kejeron, ci onywalo kwede Acikur ma ocako taun Tekoa.<verse eid="1CH 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25" />Lutino awobe pa Jeramel ma latin pa Kejeron gin aye Ram ma latin kayone, ki Bunga, Oren, Ojem ki Akija. <verse eid="1CH 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26" />Jeramel onongo tye ki dakone mukene bene ma nyinge Atara; en aye min Onam <verse eid="1CH 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27" />Lutino awobe pa Ram ma latin kayo pa Jeramel gin aye Naaj, Jamin ki Eker. <verse eid="1CH 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28" />Lutino awobe pa Onam gin aye Camai ki Jada. Lutino awobe pa Camai aye Nadab ki Abicur. <verse eid="1CH 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29" />Nying dako pa Abicur obedo Abikail; en aye onywalo Aban ki Molid. <verse eid="1CH 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30" />Lutino awobe pa Nadab gin aye Celed ki Apaim. Celed oto ma pe ki latin mo. <verse eid="1CH 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31" />Latin awobi pa Apaim aye Ici. Latin awobi pa Ici aye Cecan. Latin awobi pa Cecan en aye Aklai. <verse eid="1CH 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32" />Lutino awobe pa Jada ma omin Camai gin aye Jeter ki Yonacan; Jeter oto ma pe ki latin mo. <verse eid="1CH 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33" />Lutino awobe pa Yonacan gin aye Pelet ki Jaja. Jo magi ducu gin likwayo pa Jeramel. <verse eid="1CH 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34" />Cecan yam pe ki lutino awobe; onywalo anyira keken. Ento Cecan onongo tye ki opiine ma Laejipt ma nyinge Jara. <verse eid="1CH 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35" />Cecan omiyo nyare bot opiine Jara, ci onywalo kwede Atai. <verse eid="1CH 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36" />Atai onywalo Natan, Natan onywalo Jabad. <verse eid="1CH 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37" />Jabad onywalo Eplal, Eplal onywalo Obed, <verse eid="1CH 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38" />Obed onywalo Yeko, Yeko onywalo Ajaria. <verse eid="1CH 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39" />Ajaria onywalo Kelej, ki Kelej onywalo Eleaca, <verse eid="1CH 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40" />Eleaca onywalo Cicimai, ki Cicimai onywalo Calum. <verse eid="1CH 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41" />Calum onywalo Jekamia, Jekamia onywalo Elicama.<verse eid="1CH 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42" />Lutino awobe pa Kaleb ma omin Jeramel gin ene: Meca ma latin kayone obedo won Jip. Latin awobi pa Jip aye Mareca ma won Kebron. <verse eid="1CH 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43" />Lutino awobe pa Kebron aye Kora, Tapua, Rekem ki Cema. <verse eid="1CH 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44" />Cema onywalo Rakam ma won Jorkeam, Rekem onywalo Camai. <verse eid="1CH 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45" />Latin awobi pa Camai en aye Maon; Maon onywalo Bengur. <verse eid="1CH 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46" />Kaleb obedo ki dako ma angeca bene ma nyinge Epa; en aye onywalo Karan, Moja ki Gajej; Karan bene obedo ki wode ma nyinge Gajej. <verse eid="1CH 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47" />Lutino awobe pa Jadai gin aye Regem, Yocam, Gecan, Pelet, Epa ki Caap. <verse eid="1CH 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48" />Maaka ma dako pa Kaleb ma angeca onywalo Ceber ki Tirkana. <verse eid="1CH 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49" />Dako meno bene dok onywalo Caap ma ocako gang Madmana, ki Ceva ma ocako gangi Makbena ki Gibea, Akaca obedo nya pa Kaleb. <verse eid="1CH 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50" />Jo man ducu gin likwayo pa Kaleb. Lutino awobe pa Kur ma latin kayo pa dakone Eprata, gin aye Cobal ma ocako taun madit ma kilwongo ni Kiriat-jearim. <verse eid="1CH 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51" />Calma aye ocako Beterekem, ki Karep aye ocako Bet-gader. <verse eid="1CH 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52" />Likwayo pa Cobal ma ocako Kiriat-jearim gin aye jo Karoe ki nucu pa jo Menukot. <verse eid="1CH 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53" />Ludogola me kaka pa jo Kiriat-jearim gubedo jo man: gin aye jo Itri, jo Put, jo Cumat ki jo Micra; jo Jora ki jo Ectaol bene gua ki ikomgi. <verse eid="1CH 2:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54" />Likwayo pa Calma ma ocako taun me Beterekem gin aye jo Netopa, jo Atrotbet-joab, nucu pa jo Manakat, ki jo Jora. <verse eid="1CH 2:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55" />Kaka pa ludiro me coc ducu ma gibedo i Jabej gin aye jo Tira, jo Cimea ki jo Cuka. Magi aye jo Keni ma gubedo kanyome ki jo ma i dog ot pa Rekab.<verse eid="1CH 2:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lutino awobe pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1" />Magi aye lutino awobe pa Daudi ma en onywalo i Kebron: latin kayone aye Amnon, ma mine obedo Akinoam me Jejreel; me aryone Daniel, ma mine obedo Abigail me Karmel. <verse eid="1CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2" />Latin laco me adeke obedo Abcalom, ma mine Maaka ma nya pa Talmai rwot me Gecur; me angwene Adoniya, ma mine Kagit; <verse eid="1CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3" />me abice Cepatia, ma mine Abital ki me abicele Itream, ma mine Egla. <verse eid="1CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">2 Cam 5:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:11">1 Luk 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:27">1 Tek 29:27</ref></char></note>Daudi onywalo jo abiceli i Kebron, kama yam obedo kaloc iye pi mwaka abiro ki dwe abicel. Ka dok obedo kaloc i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyer adek wiye adek. <verse eid="1CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:3">2 Cam 11:3</ref></char></note> Lutino co ma Daudi onywalogi ki i Jerucalem gin aye: Cimea, Cobab, Natan ki Solomon. Gin angweni ducu mingi obedo Batceba ma nya pa Amiel. <verse eid="1CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6" />Ka dok onywalo Ibar, Elicama, Elipelet, <verse eid="1CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7" />Noga, Nepeg, Japia, <verse eid="1CH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8" />Elicama, Eliada ki Elipelet, gin abongwen. <verse eid="1CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9" />Magi ducu gin lutino awobe pa Daudi, ma pe kikwano iye lutino pa mon angecane; ki lamingi en aye Tamar.<verse eid="1CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10" />Likwayo pa Solomon gin ene: Solomon onywalo wode Rekoboam, Rekoboam onywalo Abija, Abija onywalo Aca, Aca onywalo Yekocapat, <verse eid="1CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11" />Yekocapat onywalo Joram, Joram onywalo Akajia, Akajia onywalo Yoaci, <verse eid="1CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12" />Yoaci onywalo Amajia, Amajia onywalo Ajaria, Ajaria onywalo Yocam, <verse eid="1CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13" />Yocam onywalo Akaj, Akaj onywalo Kejekia, Kejekia onywalo Manace, <verse eid="1CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14" />Manace onywalo Amon, Amon onywalo Yocia. <verse eid="1CH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15" />Lutino awobe pa Yocia gin aye Yokanan ma latin kayone, me aryone Yekoyakim, me adeke Jedekia me angwene Calum. <verse eid="1CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16" />Likwayo pa Yekoyakim gin ene: en onywalo wode Yekonia, Yekonia onywalo Jedekia.<verse eid="1CH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Yekoyakin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17" />Ka dok lutino awobe pa Yekoyakin mayam kiterogi i opiini gin ene: Cealtiel, <verse eid="1CH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18" />Malkiram Pedaya, Cenajar, Jekamia, Kocama ki Nedabia. <verse eid="1CH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19" />Lutino awobe pa Pedaya gin aye Jerubabel ki Cimei. Lutino awobe pa Jerubabel aye Meculam ki Anania, ma lamingi aye Celomit. <verse eid="1CH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20" />Lutino awobe pa Jerubabel mukene gin aye Kacuba, Okel, Berekia, Kacadia ki Jucab-keced, gin ducu abic. <verse eid="1CH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21" />Likwayo pa Anania gin ene: Anania onywalo Pelatia ki Jecaya. Jecaya onywalo Repaya, Repaya onywalo Aman, Aman onywalo Obadia, Obadia onywalo Cekania. <verse eid="1CH 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22" />Awobi pa Cekania aye Cemaya. Lutino awobe pa Cemaya gin aye Katuc, Igal, Baria, Nearia ki Capat, gin ducu abicel. <verse eid="1CH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23" />Lutino awobe pa Nearia gin aye Elioenai, Kijikia ki Ajrikam, gin ducu adek. <verse eid="1CH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24" />Lutino awobe pa Elioenai gin aye Kodavia, Eliacib, Pelaya, Akub, Yokanan, Delaya ki Anani, gin ducu abiro.<verse eid="1CH 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1" />Lutino awobe pa Juda gin aye Perej; Kejeron, Karmi, Kur ki Cobal.<verse eid="1CH 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2" />Re-aya ma wod pa Cobal onywalo Jakat, Jakat onywalo Akumai ki Lakad. Meno aye dogola pa jo ma obedo i Jora.<verse eid="1CH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3" />Kur onywalo awobe adek ma gin aye Etam, Penuel ki Ejer. Magi aye lutino awobe pa Etam: Jejreel, Icima ki Idibac. Nying lamingi obedo Kajelelponi. <verse eid="1CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4" />Penuel ocako gang Gedor, ki Ejer ocako gang Kuca. Magi aye lutino awobe pa Kur ma obedo latin kayo pa mine Eprata; en aye ocako Beterekem. <verse eid="1CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5" />Acikur ma ocako gang Tekoa, yam tye ki mon aryo, Kela ki Naara. <verse eid="1CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6" />Naara onywalo Akujam, Keper, Temeni ki Akactari. Meno aye lutino awobe pa Naara. <verse eid="1CH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7" />Lutino awobe pa Kela gin aye Jeret, Ijar ki Etanan. <verse eid="1CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8" />Koj onywalo Anub ki Jobeba; jo me dogola pa Akarkel ma wod pa Karum ducu gubedo likwaye.<verse eid="1CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9" />Jabej onongo kiworo makato omegine ducu. Mine ocako nyinge Jabej kun waco ni, “Pien anywale ki arem madwong.” <verse eid="1CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10" />Jabej okok bot Lubanga pa jo Icrael kun waco ni, “Tim ber, i miya gum ci imii lobona obed malac. Bed kweda, i gwoka ikom gin marac ducu wek pe otima malit.” Ci Lubanga oye gin ma en olego.<verse eid="1CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11" />Kelub ma omin Cuka onywalo Mekir, Mekir onywalo Eciton. <verse eid="1CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12" />Eciton onywalo Bet-rapa, Pacea ki Tekina ma ocako taun madit ma kilwongo ni Nakac. Likwayo pa jo magi gubedo i Reka.<verse eid="1CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13" />Lutino awobe pa Kenaj gin aye Otiniel ki Ceraya. Lutino awobe pa Otiniel aye Katat ki Meonatai. <verse eid="1CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14" />Meonatai onywalo Opra. Ceraya onywalo Joab ma ocako nota pa lutic diro. Gin ma omiyo kilwongo kitmeno, pien gin ducu lutic diro.<verse eid="1CH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15" />Lutino awobe pa Kaleb ma wod pa Jepune gin aye Iru, Ela ki Naam. Latin awobi pa Ela aye Kenaj.<verse eid="1CH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16" />Lutino awobe pa Jekalelel gin aye Jip, Jipa, Tiria ki Acarel. <verse eid="1CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17" />Lutino awobe pa Ejra gin aye Jeter, Mered, Eper ki Jalon. Mered onyomo Bitia ma nya pa Parao. Mered onywalo nyare Miriam ki lutino awobe aryo, Camai ki Iciba ma ocako taun me Ectemoa. <verse eid="1CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18" />Mered ki dakone ma Lajuda onywalo Jered ma ocako taun me Gedor, Keber ma ocako taun me Coko. Jekutiel ocako taun me Janoa. <verse eid="1CH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19" />Lutino awobe pa dako pa Kodia ma lamin Nakam gunywalo jo magi, Keila ma obedo kwaro pa jo Garmi ki Ectemoa ma obedo kwaro pa jo Maaka.<verse eid="1CH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20" />Lutino awobe pa Cimon gin aye Amnon, Rina, Ben-kanan ki Tilon. Lutino awobe pa Ici gin aye Joket ki Ben-joket.<verse eid="1CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Cela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21" />Likwayo pa Cela ma wod pa Juda aye Er ma ocako taun me Leka. Laada ma ocako taun me Mareca, ki dogola pa lucwe camanini ducu ma gibedo i Bet-acibea; <verse eid="1CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22" />ki Jokim ki jo Koceba ki Yoaci ki Carap mayam obedo laloc i Moab ka dok odwogo obedo i Beterekem. (Magi tekwaro macon tutwal.) <verse eid="1CH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23" />Jonu aye lucwe agulu ki jo ma gubedo i Netaim ki i Gedera. Onongo gibedo kunu kacel ki rwot pi tiyo tice.<verse eid="1CH 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Cimeon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24" />Lutino awobe pa Cimeon gin aye Nemuel, Jamin, Jarib, Jera ki Caul. <verse eid="1CH 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25" />Caul onywalo wode Calum, Calum onywalo Mibcam, Mibcam onywalo Micima. <verse eid="1CH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26" />Lutino awobe pa Micima gin aye wode Kamuel, ma wode Jakur, ma wode Cimei. <verse eid="1CH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27" />Cimei onongo tye ki awobene apar wiye abicel ki anyirane abicel; ento omegine pe gubedo ki lutino mapol, kadi wa ludogolagi ducu pe gunya mapol marom ki jo Juda. <verse eid="1CH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:2-8">Yoc 19:2-8</ref></char></note>Gin yam gibedo i Beer-ceba, Molada, Kajar-cual, <verse eid="1CH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29" />Bila, Ejem, Tolad, <verse eid="1CH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30" />Becweri, Korma, Jiklag, <verse eid="1CH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31" />Bet-markabot, Kajar-cucim, Bet-biri ki Caaraim. Magi aye obedo taun gi nio wa ikare me loc pa Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32" />Kabedo mukene ma gin gubedo iye gin aye Etam, Ain, Rimmon, Token ki Acan, taun gi ducu abic, <verse eid="1CH 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33" />kacel ki gangi matino ma orumu taun gi man ducu nio kwede wa i Baalat. Magi aye kabedogi, dok gin aye gubedo ki buk me tekwarogi.<verse eid="1CH 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34" />Mecobab, Jamlek, Joca ma wod pa Amajia, <verse eid="1CH 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35" />Joel, Yeko ma wod pa Jocibia, wod pa Ceraya, ma wod pa Aciel, <verse eid="1CH 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36" />Elionia, Jaakona, Jecokaya, Acaya, Adiel, Jecimiel, Benaya, <verse eid="1CH 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37" />Jija wod pa Cipi ma wod pa Alon, wod pa Jedaya, wod pa Cimri, ma wod pa Cemaya, <verse eid="1CH 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38" />jo magi ducu ma kicoyo nyinggi maloni gin aye lutel me dogolagi. Dog odi pa kwarigi onya madwong, <verse eid="1CH 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39" />ci gucako wot nio wa i yoo ma donyo i Gerar, kun girabo dog nota tung kunyango pi yenyo kakwayo romigi ki dyegigi. <verse eid="1CH 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40" />Gin gunongo kakwat maber kunu ma lum olot iye madwong, lobone bene lac ma obedo mot ki kuc. Jo ma gukwongo bedo kunu aye jo Kam. <verse eid="1CH 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41" />Jo meno ma kicoyo nyingini guo kunu ikare pa Kejekia rwot me Juda, ci guneko jo Kam woko, kacel ki jo Meun ma gunongo kunu, gutyekogi woko liweng nio wa i kareni. Kitmeno en aye guleyo kabedogi woko, pien onongo kakwayo romigi ki dyegigi tye kunu maber. <verse eid="1CH 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42" />Jo mogo ma ikin gi, jo Cimeon ma giromo miya abic, gucito wa i got Ceir kun gitye ki jo magi ma lutela wigi: Pelatia, Nearia, Repaya ki Ujiel ma gin lutino awobe pa Ici. <verse eid="1CH 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43" />Gin guneko jo Amalek mayam guringo ci gubwot ma dong onongo gibedo kununi liweng, ci gucako bedo kunu nio wa onyo.<verse eid="1CH 4:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Reuben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 35:22">Aca 35:22</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:3-4">49:3-4</ref></char>
    </note>Man lok kom likwayo pa Reuben ma latin kayo pa Icrael. Reuben aye latin kayo, ento otimo kir pi bedo ki ciwone. Pimeno twero me dite me anywali kimiyo bot lutino awobe pa Yucepu, wod pa Icrael. <verse eid="1CH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8-10">Aca 4:8-10</ref></char></note>Dok kadi bed Juda yam obedo oteka ikin omegine, dok laker bene ononge ki ikin likwaye, ento dit me anywali onongo tye bot Yucepu. <verse eid="1CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3" />Lutino awobe pa Reuben ma latin kayo pa Icrael gin aye Kanok, Pallu, Kejeron ki Karmi.<verse eid="1CH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:29">2 Luk 15:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lutino awobe pa Joel gin ene: Joel onywalo wode Cemaya, Cemaya onywalo wode Gog, Gog onywalo wode Cimei, <verse eid="1CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5" />Cimei onywalo wode Mika, Mika onywalo wode Re-aya, Re-aya onywalo wode Baal, <verse eid="1CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6" />Baal onywalo wode Beera mayam Tiglat-pilecer rwot me Aciria obino omako otero woko i opii; en yam obedo ladit pa jo Reuben.<verse eid="1CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7" />Lukakagi yam kicoyo tekwarogi kun lubu yalwakgi ki dogolagi, gin ene: laditgi Jeyel, ki Jekaria, <verse eid="1CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8" />ki Bela wod pa Ajaj ma wod pa Joel; en yam bedo i Aroer, ma lobone oo wa i Nebo ki Baal-meon. <verse eid="1CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9" />En yam obedo bene tung kunyango ma lobone o wa i dog tim ma inget kulu Euprate tung aroo, pien onongo dong leegi onya madwong i lobo Gilead. <verse eid="1CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10" />Ikare pa Caulo jo pa Reuben gubedo kalweny ki jo Agri ci gunekogi, ka gucako bedo i kemagi i lobo ducu ma inget lobo Gilead tung kunyango.<verse eid="1CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Gad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11" />Likwayo pa Gad gubedo i lobo Bacan nio kwede wa i Caleka, kun gukeme ki jo Reuben. <verse eid="1CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12" />Joel obedo laditgi, me aryone, Capamo, Janai ki Capat bene gubedo i Bacan. <verse eid="1CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13" />Lukakagi gupoke i dogola mapatpat: ma kwarigi obedo Mikael, Meculam, Ceba, Jorai, Jakan, Jia ki Eber, ma gin ducu abiro. <verse eid="1CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14" />Magi aye gubedo likwayo pa Abikail wod pa Kuri, ma wod pa Jaroa, wod pa Gilead, wod pa Mikael, wod pa Jecicai, wod pa Jado, wod pa Buj. <verse eid="1CH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15" />Aki wod pa Abdiel ma wod pa Guni, en aye obedo ladit maloyo dog odi pa kwarigi. <verse eid="1CH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16" />Gin gubedo i Gilead, i Bacan ki i gangi ma i lobo meno, ki i kakwat ducu ma i lobo Caron, nio wa iwang lobo kikome. <verse eid="1CH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17" />Jo magi ducu kicoyo nyinggi ikare pa Yocam rwot me Juda, ki ikare pa Jeroboam rwot me Icrael.<verse eid="1CH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok kom lumony ma tung kunyango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18" />Jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad, ki nucu kaka pa Manace yam gitye ki twoni oteka lweny ma gitye ki kwotgi ki pala lucwangi, ma gitelo atumgi bene, ma gin oyita lweny, dano alip pyere angwen wiye angwen, ki miya abiro ki pyere abicel ma guyube pi lweny. <verse eid="1CH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19" />Gulwenyo ki Jekur, Napic ki Nodab, ma gin jo Agri. <verse eid="1CH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20" />Lubanga okonyogi obedo kalweny kwedgi, pien gukok bote ikare ma gilwenyo, ci en oye legagi pien onongo gigene, ci omiyo jo Agri ki lwakgi ducu i cinggi. <verse eid="1CH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21" />Guyako leegi makwo maromo man: kinaga alip pyere abic kulu, romi alip miya aryo ki pyere abic, ki kana alip aryo, kacel ki dano alip miya acel ma kiyakogi makwo. <verse eid="1CH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22" />Gin guneko jo mapol, pien monye obedo i miti pa Lubanga. Ci gubedo i lobo pa jonu nio wa ikare ma kiterogi woko i opii.<verse eid="1CH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23" />Jo me nucu kaka pa Manace gubedo i lobo meno. Gubedo jo mapol mada cake ki i lobo Bacan nio kwede wa i Baal-kermon, Cenir ki got Kermon.<verse eid="1CH 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24" />Magi aye ludito wi kaka ma i odi pa kwarigi: Eper, Ici, Eliel, Ajriel, Jeremia, Kodavia ki Jadiel, ma gin twoni oteka lweny ma nyiggi oywek, ma gin aye ludito i odi pa kwarigi.<verse eid="1CH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kitero kaka ma tung kunyango i opii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25" />Ento onongo jonu gungayo wang Lubanga pa kwarigi, pien gubedo ka woro lubanga pa jo me lobo meno, ma gin aye jo ma Lubanga yam otyekogi woko ki i nyimgini. <verse eid="1CH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:19">2 Luk 15:19</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 15:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 1:6">1:6</ref></char></note>Pimeno Lubanga opiyo Pul rwot me Aciria, ma en aye Tiglat-pilecer rwot me Aciria, ci oterogi i opii, gin aye jo Reuben, jo Gad ki nucu kaka pa jo Manace. En oterogi wa i Kalak, Kabor, Kara ki i kulu Gojan, ma pud gitye kunu nio wa onyo.<verse eid="1CH 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Levi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1" />Lutino awobe pa Levi gin aye Gercom, Kokat ki Merari. <verse eid="1CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2" />Lutino awobe pa Kokat gin aye Amram, Ijur, Kebron ki Ujiel. <verse eid="1CH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3" />Lutino pa Amram gin aye Aron, Moses ki Miriam. Lutino awobe pa Aron gin aye Nadab, Abiu, Eleajar ki Itamar. <verse eid="1CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4" />Eleajar onywalo Finekaci, Finekaci onywalo Abicua, <verse eid="1CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5" />Abicua onywalo Bukki, Bukki onywalo Uji, <verse eid="1CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6" />Uji onywalo Jerakia, Jerakia onywalo Merayot, <verse eid="1CH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7" />Merayot onywalo Amaria, Amaria onywalo Akitub, <verse eid="1CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8" />Akitub onywalo Jadok, Jadok onywalo Akimaj, <verse eid="1CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9" />Akimaj onywalo Ajaria, Ajaria onywalo Yokanan, <verse eid="1CH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10" />Yokanan onywalo Ajaria, ma en aye obedo ajwaka ma otiyo i Ot pa Lubanga mayam Solomon ogero i Jerucalem. <verse eid="1CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11" />Ajaria onywalo Amaria, Amaria onywalo Akitub, <verse eid="1CH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12" />Akitub onywalo Jadok, Jadok onywalo Calum, <verse eid="1CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13" />Calum onywalo Ilkia, Ilkia onywalo Ajaria, <verse eid="1CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14" />Ajaria onywalo Ceraya, Ceraya onywalo Yekojadak. <verse eid="1CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15" />Yekojadak kitero woko i opii ikare ma Rwot omiyo Nebukadnejar otero jo Juda ki jo Jerucalem i opii.<verse eid="1CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 6:16-19">Nia 6:16-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lutino awobe pa Levi aye Gercom, Kokat ki Merari. <verse eid="1CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17" />Magi aye nyig lutino awobe pa Gercom: Libni ki Cimei. <verse eid="1CH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18" />Lutino awobe pa Kokat gin aye Amram, Ijar, Kebron ki Ujiel. <verse eid="1CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19" />Lutino awobe pa Merari aye Makali ki Muci. Magi aye dogola pa jo Levi, ma lubu kwarigi. <verse eid="1CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20" />Likwayo pa Gercom gin ene: Gercom onywalo wode Libni, Libni onywalo Jakat, Jakat onywalo Jima, <verse eid="1CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21" />Jima onywalo Joa, Joa onywalo Iddo, Iddo onywalo Jera, Jera onywalo Jeaterai. <verse eid="1CH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22" />Likwayo pa Kokat gin ene: Kokat onywalo wode Aminadab, Aminadab onywalo Kora, Kora onywalo Acir, <verse eid="1CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23" />Acir onywalo Elkana, Elkana onywalo Ebiacap, Ebiacap onywalo Acir, <verse eid="1CH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24" />Acir onywalo Takat, Takat onywalo Uriel, Uriel onywalo Ujia, Ujia onywalo Kaul. <verse eid="1CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25" />Likwayo pa Elkana gin aye Amacai ki Akimot, <verse eid="1CH 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26" />ma wode Elkana, Elkana onywalo Jopai, Jopai onywalo Nakat, <verse eid="1CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27" />Nakat onywalo Eliab, Eliab onywalo Jerokam, Jerokam onywalo Elkana. <verse eid="1CH 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28" />Lutino awobe pa Camuel gin aye Joel ma latin kayone, ki me aryone Abija. <verse eid="1CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29" />Likwayo pa Merari gin ene: Merari onywalo Makali, Makali onywalo Libni, Libni onywalo Cimei, Cimei onywalo Uja, <verse eid="1CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30" />Uja onywalo Cimea, Cimea onywalo Kagia, Kagia onywalo Acaya.<verse eid="1CH 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luwer i Ot pa Lubanga ma Daudi oketogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31" />Magi aye jo ma Daudi oketogi me loyo tic me wer i Ot pa Lubanga, ikare ma kitero Canduk pa Rwot ci kiketo obedo iye. <verse eid="1CH 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32" />Ticgi obedo me wer inyim kema, ma en aye Kema me Rwate, nio wa ikare ma Solomon dong ogero Ot pa Rwot i Jerucalem. Gubedo katiyo ticgi kun gilubu cik ma kimiyogi. <verse eid="1CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33" />Magi aye nyig dano ma gutiyo tic meno, ki nyig likwayogi. Likwayo pa Kokat gin ene: Eman ma lawer, ma wod pa Joel, wod pa Camuel, <verse eid="1CH 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34" />wod pa Elkana, wod pa Jerokam, wod pa Eliel, wod pa Toa, <verse eid="1CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35" />wod pa Jup, wod pa Elkana, wod pa Makat, wod pa Amacai, <verse eid="1CH 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36" />wod pa Elkana, wod pa Joel, wod pa Ajaria, wod pa Jepania, <verse eid="1CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37" />wod pa Takat, wod pa Acir, wod pa Ebiacap, wod pa Kora, <verse eid="1CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38" />wod pa Ijar, wod pa Kokat, wod pa Levi, wod pa Icrael; <verse eid="1CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39" />ki omine Acap mayam cung kangete tung bade ma lacuc. Acap obedo wod pa Berekia, wod pa Cimea, <verse eid="1CH 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40" />wod pa Mikael, wod pa Baaceya, wod pa Malkija, <verse eid="1CH 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41" />wod pa Etini, wod pa Jera, wod pa Adaya, <verse eid="1CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42" />wod pa Etan, wod pa Jima, wod pa Cimei, <verse eid="1CH 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43" />wod pa Jakat, wod pa Gercom, wod pa Levi.<verse eid="1CH 6:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44" />Omegigi ma likwayo pa Merari yam gicung tung lacam; gin ene: Etan wod pa Kici, wod pa Abdi, wod pa Maluk, <verse eid="1CH 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45" />wod pa Kacabia, wod pa Amajia, wod pa Ilkia, <verse eid="1CH 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46" />wod pa Amji, wod pa Bani, wod pa Cemer, <verse eid="1CH 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47" />wod pa Makali, wod pa Muci, wod pa Merari, wod pa Levi. <verse eid="1CH 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48" />Yam kiketo omegigi mukene ma gin Lulevi me tiyo tic ducu ma i kema, ma en aye Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="1CH 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Aron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49" />Ento Aron ki awobene aye gityero gityer iwi keno tyer me gitum awanga, ki i keno tyer me wango odok eceta. Gin aye onongo gitiyo tic ducu ma i Kabedo Maleng Makato ducu, ki tic me kwanyo bal ki ikom jo Icrael, kit ma Moses latic pa Lubanga yam ociko kwede ducu. <verse eid="1CH 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50" />Magi aye likwayo pa Aron: en onywalo wode Eleajar, ma wode Finekaci, ma wode Abicua, <verse eid="1CH 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51" />ma wode Bukki, ma wode Uji, ma wode Jerakia, <verse eid="1CH 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52" />ma wode Merayot, ma wode Amaria, ma wode Akitub, <verse eid="1CH 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53" />ma wode Jadok, ma wode Akimaj.<verse eid="1CH 6:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kama Lulevi bedo iye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOS 21:1-42">Yoc 21:1-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54" />Magi aye kabedo kama likwayo pa Aron ma i dogola pa jo Kokat yam gubedo iye, ma oporo kit bedogi ki wang lobogi, kit ma kibolo kwir opoto kwede. <verse eid="1CH 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55" />Yam kimiyo bot Lulevi Kebron matye i lobo Juda, kacel ki olet ma orumu ducu. <verse eid="1CH 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56" />Poti ki gangi ducu matye pi taun madit meno, kimiyogi ducu bot Kaleb wod pa Jepune. <verse eid="1CH 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57" />Ka dok likwayo pa Aron kimiyo botgi Kebron ma en aye taun madit me laro lunek dano, Libna ki olete bene, Jatir, Ectemoa ki olete, <verse eid="1CH 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58" />Kilen ki olete, Debir ki olete, <verse eid="1CH 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59" />Acan ki olete, ki Bet-cemec ki olete. <verse eid="1CH 6:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60" />Ka dok kimiyo botgi taun magi ma kikwanyo ki i lobo pa kaka me Benjamin: Geba ki olete, Alemet ki olete, Anatot ki olete. Kitmeno taun ma i dogolagi ducu onongo giromo apar wiye adek.<verse eid="1CH 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61" />Jo Kokat mudonge kipoko botgi kun kibolo kwir taun apar ma tung kupotoceng i lobo pa nucu Manace. Taun magi kikwanyogi ki bot kaka pa Manace. <verse eid="1CH 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62" />Jo Gercom kimiyo botgi taun apar wiye adek macalo dogolagi tye, ma kikwanyo ki i kaka pa Icakar, Acer, Naputali ki Manace i lobo Bacan. <verse eid="1CH 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63" />Jo Merari kimiyo botgi taun apar wiye aryo macalo dogolagi tye, ma kikwanyo ki i kaka pa Reuben, Gad ki Jabulon. <verse eid="1CH 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64" />Kitmeno jo Icrael gumiyo taun bot jo Levi kacel ki oletgi ducu, wek gubed iye. <verse eid="1CH 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65" />Gumiyo botgi taun me Cimeon ki Benjamin ma kikwanyogi ki bot kaka pa Juda, kun kibolo kwir. <verse eid="1CH 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66" />Ka dok dogola mogo pa likwayo pa Kokat kimiyo botgi taun ma kikwanyo ki bot kaka pa Epraim. <verse eid="1CH 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="1CH 6:67" />Kimiyo botgi Cekem ma en aye taun madit me laro lunek dano ma i lobo godi me Epraim, ki olete, Gejer ki olete, <verse eid="1CH 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="1CH 6:68" />Jokmeam ki olete, Bet-koron ki olete, <verse eid="1CH 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="1CH 6:69" />Aijalon ki olete, Gat-rimmon ki olete. <verse eid="1CH 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="1CH 6:70" />Ka dok dogola pa jo Kokat mudonge ducu kimiyo botgi gangi magi ma kikwanyo ki bot nucu kaka pa Manace: Aner ki olete, Bileam ki olete.<verse eid="1CH 6:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="1CH 6:71" />Jo pa Gercom kimiyo botgi taun magi ma kikwanyo ki bot nucu kaka pa Manace: Golan ma i Bacan ki olete, Acitarot ki olete. <verse eid="1CH 6:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="1CH 6:72" />Ka dok taun magi ma kikwanyo ki bot kaka pa Icakar: Kedec ki olete, Daberat ki olete, <verse eid="1CH 6:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="1CH 6:73" />Ramot ki olete, Anem ki olete. <verse eid="1CH 6:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="1CH 6:74" />Ka dok taun magi ma kikwanyo ki bot kaka pa Acer: Macal ki olete, Abudon ki olete, <verse eid="1CH 6:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="1CH 6:75" />Kukok ki olete, Rekob ki olet. <verse eid="1CH 6:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="1CH 6:76" />Ka dok taun magi ma kikwanyo ki bot kaka pa Naputali: Kedec ma i Galilaya ki olete, Kamon ki olete, Kiriataim ki olete. <verse eid="1CH 6:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="1CH 6:77" />Jo pa Merari mudonge kimiyo botgi taun magi ma kikwanyo ki bot kaka pa Jabulon kun kibolo kwir: Rimmono ki olete, Tabor ki olete. <verse eid="1CH 6:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="1CH 6:78" />Ka dok i loka kulu Jordan tung kunyango macok ki Jeriko kimiyo botgi taun madito magi ma kikwanyo ki bot kaka pa Reuben: Bejer ma i tim aroo kacel ki olete, Jaja ki olete, <verse eid="1CH 6:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="1CH 6:79" />Kedemot ki olete, Mepaat ki olete. <verse eid="1CH 6:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="1CH 6:80" />Ka dok taun madito magi ma kikwanyo ki bot kaka pa Gad: Ramot ma i Gilead ki olete, Makanaim ki olete, <verse eid="1CH 6:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="1CH 6:81" />Kecbon ki olete, Jajer ki olete.<verse eid="1CH 6:81" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7" />
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Icakar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1" />Lutino awobe pa Icakar obedo angwen gin aye: Tola, Puwa, Jacub ki Cimron. <verse eid="1CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2" />Lutino awobe pa Tola aye Uji, Repaya, Jeriel, Jamai, Ibcam ki Cemuel. Gin aye ludito kaka pa jo Tola ki i odi pa kwarigi ma gubedo twoni oteka lweny ki i yalwakgi. Ikare pa Daudi welgi nongo oromo alip pyere aryo wiye aryo ki miya abicel. <verse eid="1CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3" />Latin awobi pa Uji aye Ijrakia. Lutino awobe pa Ijrakia aye Mikael, Obadia, Joel ki Icia, gin kacel ki won gi Ijrakia gubedo ludito wi kaka. <verse eid="1CH 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4" />Ka dok onongo tye lwak buca mony pa lulweny ma kicoyo nyinggi ma lubu yalwakgi ma i dog odi pa kwarigi; welgi obedo alip pyere adek wiye abicel, pien onongo gitye ki mon mapol ki lutino awobe mapol. <verse eid="1CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5" />Lukakagi ma i dogola pa Icakar ducu onongo giromo twoni oteka lweny alip pyere aboro wiye abiro ma kicoyo nyinggi i buk me tekwarogi.<verse eid="1CH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6" />Lutino awobe pa Benjamin obedo adek, gin aye Bela, Beker ki Jediael. <verse eid="1CH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7" />Lutino awobe pa Bela aye Ejibon, Uji, Ujiel, Jerimot ki Iri. Gin abic ducu gubedo ludito wi kaka ma i odi pa kwarigi, dok gin obedo twoni oteka lweny. Ikare mayam kicoyo nyinggi ibuk me tekwaro, welgi oromo alip pyere aryo wiye aryo ki pyere adek wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8" />Lutino awobe pa Beker gin aye Jemira, Yoaci, Eliejer, Elioenai, Omri, Jeremot, Abija, Anatot ki Alemet; jo magi ducu gin awobe pa Beker. <verse eid="1CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9" />Yam kicoyo nyinggi i buk me tekwaro ma lubu yalwakgi, kun gin gubedo ludito wi kaka i odi pa kwarigi, dok bene twoni oteka lweny. Welgi onongo romo alip pyere aryo ki miya aryo. <verse eid="1CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10" />Latin awobi pa Jediael aye Bilan. Lutino awobe pa Bilan aye Jeuc, Benjamin, Ekud, Kenaana, Jetan, Tarcic ki Akicakar. <verse eid="1CH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11" />Magi ducu likwayo pa Jediael ma gin gubedo ludito kaka i odi pa kwarigi, gin bene gubedo twoni oteka lweny; welgi ducu oromo alip apar wiye abiro ki miya aryo ma onongo guyube maber pi lweny. <verse eid="1CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12" />Cupim ki Kupim gin aye lutino awobe pa Ir. Kucim obedo latin awobi pa Aker.<verse eid="1CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Naputali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13" />Lutino awobe pa Naputali gin aye Jajiel, Guni, Jejer ki Calum, gin aye likwayo pa Bila.<verse eid="1CH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Manace</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14" />Lutino awobe pa Manace aye Aciriel ki Makir ma obedo won Gilead. Gin aryo ducu lutino pa dako angecane ma anyira jo Aram. <verse eid="1CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15" />Makir onyomo dako ki Kupim ki Cupim bene. Nying lamine aye Maaka. Nying wode me aryone Jelopekad. Jelopekad onywalo anyira keken. <verse eid="1CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16" />Maaka ma dako pa Makir onywalo awobe aryo ma ocako nyinggi Perec ki Cerec. Lutino awobe pa Perec aye Ulam ki Rakem. <verse eid="1CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17" />Latin awobi pa Ulam aye Bedan. Magi gin likwayo pa Gilead wod pa Makir, ma wod pa Manace. <verse eid="1CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18" />Kamoleket ma lamin Gilead onywalo Icikod, Abiejer ki Makala. <verse eid="1CH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19" />Lutino awobe pa Cemida gin aye Akian, Cekem, Liki ki Aniam.<verse eid="1CH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Epraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20" />Likwayo pa Epraim gin aye Cutela ma wode Bered, ma wode Takat, ma wode Eleada, ma wode Takat, <verse eid="1CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21" />ma wode Jabad, ma wode Cutela. Lutino awobe mukene pa Epraim aye Ejer ki Elead ma jo Gat ma gin wegi lobo meno onekogi woko ikare ma awobe meno gucito ka yako dyangigi. <verse eid="1CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22" />Won gi Epraim obedo kakokogi pi kare malac, dok omegine bene gubino kakweyo cwinye. <verse eid="1CH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23" />Lacen Epraim obutu ki dakone ci dako ogamo ic, ci onywalo wode. Ci wone ocako nyinge Beria, pien onongo can opoto i ode. <verse eid="1CH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24" />Nyare obedo Ceera; en aye ogero taun me Bet-koron ma pinye ki ma malone, ki bene Ujen-ceera. <verse eid="1CH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25" />Wod pa Beria aye Repa ma wode Recep, ma wode Tela, ma wode Takan, <verse eid="1CH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26" />ma wode Ladan ma wode Amikud, ma wode Elicama, <verse eid="1CH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27" />ma wode Nun, ma wode Yocwa. <verse eid="1CH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28" />Lobogi ki kabedogi en aye Betel ki taun ma ingete, Naaran ma odok tung kunyango, ki Gejer matye tung kupotoceng, Cekem ki taun madito ma ingete, Aya ki taun ma ingete.<verse eid="1CH 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29" />Wang lobo pa jo Manace, aye Bet-cean ki taun madit ma ingete, Taanak ki taun ma ingete, Megiddo ki taun ma ingete, Dor ki taun ma ingete.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 7:29">Likwayo pa Yucepu wod pa Icrael yam gubedo i kabedo magi ducu.<verse eid="1CH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Acer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30" />Lutino awobe pa Acer gin aye Imna, Iciva, Icivi, Beria ki Cera ma lamin gi. <verse eid="1CH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31" />Lutino awobe pa Beria gin aye Keber ki Malkiel ma ocako taun madit me Bir-jait. <verse eid="1CH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32" />Keber onywalo Japulet, Gomer, Kotam ki Cua ma lamin gi. <verse eid="1CH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33" />Lutino awobe pa Japulet aye Racak, Bimal ki Acivat. <verse eid="1CH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34" />Lutino awobe pa omine Cemer aye Roga, Jekuba ki Aram. <verse eid="1CH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35" />Lutino awobe pa omine Keler gin aye Jopa, Imna. Celec ki Amal. <verse eid="1CH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36" />Lutino awobe pa Jopa aye Cua, Karneper, Cual, Beri, Imra, <verse eid="1CH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37" />Bejer, Kod, Camma, Ciloa, Itran ki Beera. <verse eid="1CH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38" />Lutino awobe pa Jeter aye Jepune, Picpa ki Ara. <verse eid="1CH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39" />Lutino awobe pa Ula aye Ara, Kaniel ki Rijia. <verse eid="1CH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40" />Magi ducu obedo jo pa Acer, ma gubedo ludito kaka i odi pa kwarigi. Gin gubedo jo ma kiyerogi ma gitye twoni oteka lweny, kun gin bene lutela wi kaka. Ikare ma nongo kicoyo nyinggi pi tic me lweny, welgi onongo romo alip pyere aryo wiye abicel.<verse eid="1CH 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8" />
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1" />Benjamin onywalo lutino awobe abic. Ma lube ki ditogi gin en aye: Bela, Acibel, Akara, <verse eid="1CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2" />Noka ki Rapia. <verse eid="1CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3" />Bela onywalo lutino awobe bene ma gin aye Adar, Gera, Abikud, <verse eid="1CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4" />Abicua, Naaman, Akoa, <verse eid="1CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5" />Gera, Cepupan ki Kuram. <verse eid="1CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6" />Magi aye likwayo pa Ekud; gin gubedo ludito kaka i odi pa kwarigi ikin jo mayam gibedo i Geba, ma kiterogi i opii wa i Manakat. Gin ene: <verse eid="1CH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:7" />Naaman, Akija ki Gera, ma en aye Keglam, ma obedo won Uja ki Akikud. <verse eid="1CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8" />Cakaraim onywalo lutino awobe i lobo Moab, ma dong otyeko ryemo mone Kucim ki Baara woko. <verse eid="1CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9" />En onywalo lutino awobe ki dakone Kedec, gin aye Jobab, Jibia, Meca, Malkam, <verse eid="1CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10" />Jeuj, Cakia ki Mirma. Magi aye lutino awobene ma gubedo ludito kaka i odi pa kwarigi. <verse eid="1CH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11" />Cakaraim onywalo lutino awobe bene ki dakone Kucim, gin aye Abitub ki Elpaal. <verse eid="1CH 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12" />Lutino awobe pa Elpaal aye Eber, Micam ki Cemed. Cemed ogero taun madit me Ono, ki Lod, ki gangi ma ingetgi.<verse eid="1CH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13" />Beria ki Cema aye gubedo ludito kaka i odi pa kwarigi ikin jo ma gubedo i Aijalon, ma guryemo jo mayam gubedo i Gat woko. <verse eid="1CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14" />Akio, Cacak, Jeremot, <verse eid="1CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15" />Jebedia, Arad, Eder, <verse eid="1CH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16" />Mikael, Icipa ki Joka gin aye likwayo pa Beria.<verse eid="1CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jo Benjamin ma i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17" />Likwayo pa Elpaal aye gubedo: Jebadia, Meculam, Kijiki, Keber, <verse eid="1CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18" />Icimerai, Ijilia ki Jobab. <verse eid="1CH 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19" />Likwayo pa Cimei gin aye: Jakim, Jikri, Jabdi, <verse eid="1CH 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20" />Elienai, Jiletai, Eliel, <verse eid="1CH 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21" />Adaya, Beraya ki Cimrat. <verse eid="1CH 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22" />Likwayo pa Cacak gin aye: Icipan, Eber, Eliel, <verse eid="1CH 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23" />Abudon, Jikri, Kanan, <verse eid="1CH 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24" />Anania, Elam, Antotija, <verse eid="1CH 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25" />Ipedaya ki Penuel. <verse eid="1CH 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26" />Likwayo pa Jerokam gin aye: Camcerai, Cekaria, Atalia, <verse eid="1CH 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27" />Jarecia, Eliya ki Jikri. <verse eid="1CH 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28" />Jo magi gubedo ludito kaka i odi pa kwarigi i yalwakgi. Gin rwodi madito, ma gin ducu gubedo i Jerucalem.<verse eid="1CH 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Benjamin ma gitye i Gibeon ki i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29" />Jeyel aye ocako taun madit me Gibeon kama en obedo iye. Nying dakone Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30" />Latin awobine me kayo aye Abudon, ka dok Jur, Kic, Baal, Nadab, <verse eid="1CH 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31" />Gedor, Akio, Jeker, <verse eid="1CH 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32" />ki Miklot, ma en aye won Cimea. Jo magi ducu yam bene gubedo kacel ki lukakagi kun gibedo cokcok ki lukakagi ma gitye kabedo i Jerucalem. <verse eid="1CH 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33" />Ner onywalo Kic, Kic onywalo Caulo, Caulo onywalo Yonacan, Malkicua, Abinadab, ki Ecibaal. <verse eid="1CH 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34" />Yonacan onywalo Meribaal, Meribaal onywalo Mika. <verse eid="1CH 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35" />Lutino awobe pa Mika gin aye Piton, Melek, Tarea ki Akaj. <verse eid="1CH 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36" />Akaj onywalo Yekoada, Yekoada onywalo Alemet, Ajimavet ki Jimri. Jimri onywalo Moja, <verse eid="1CH 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37" />Moja onywalo Binea ma wode Rapa, ma wode Eleaca, ma wode Ajel. <verse eid="1CH 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38" />Ajel yam tye ki lutino awobe abicel ma nyinggi ene: Ajrikam, Bokeru, Icmael, Cearia, Obadia ki Kanan. Jo magi ducu aye lutino awobe pa Ajel. <verse eid="1CH 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39" />Lutino awobe pa omine Ecek gin ene: Ulam ma latin kayone, me aryone Jeuc, me adeke Elipelet. <verse eid="1CH 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40" />Lutino awobe pa Ulam mayam gin twoni oteka lweny, wegi atum, ma lutino awobegi ki likwayogi onongo pol mada, gin ducu miya acel ki pyere abic. Jo magi ducu gin ducu jo me kaka pa Benjamin.<verse eid="1CH 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Dano ma gudwogo cen ki i Babilon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1" />Yam kicoyo nying jo Icrael ducu i <char style="bk">Buk me Tekwaro </char> me Icrael. Jo Juda yam kiterogi i opii i lobo Babilon me pwodogi pi bal ma gutito pien onongo gungayo wang Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:27">Eji 2:27</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 7:73">Nek 7:73</ref></char></note>Jo ma gukwongo dwogo cen ki i opii ikom kabedo me dul lobo mayam kimiyo botgi ki i gangigi gin aye jo Icrael kacel ki ajwaki pa Lubanga, Lulevi, ki lutic i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3" />Jo mogo me kaka pa Juda, Benjamin, Epraim ki Manace bene gucako bedo i Jerucalem. <verse eid="1CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4" />Gin aye Utai wod pa Amikud, ma wod pa Omri, wod pa Imri, wod pa Bani ki ikin likwayo pa Perej ma wod pa Juda. <verse eid="1CH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5" />Dok ikin likwayo pa Cela, Acaya ma obedo latin kayo ki ikin lutino awobene. <verse eid="1CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6" />Ki ikin likwayo pa Jera, Jeuel ki lukakagi, gin ducu miya abicel ki pyere abongwen nono. <verse eid="1CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7" />Ki ikin jo Benjamin Calu ma wod pa Meculam, wod pa Kodavia, wod pa Kacenua, <verse eid="1CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8" />Ibneya wod pa Jerokam, Ela wod pa Uji ma wod pa Mikri, ki Meculam wod pa Cepatia ma wod pa Reuel, wod pa Ibinija, <verse eid="1CH 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9" />kacel ki lukakagi ma lubu yalwakgi, dano miya abongwen ki pyere abic wiye abicel. Gin ducu ludito kaka i odi pa kwarigi.<verse eid="1CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10" />Ajwaki pa Lubanga ma gudwogo cen ma gubedo i Jerucalem gin aye Jedaya, Jekoyarib, Jakin <verse eid="1CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11" />ki Ajaria wod pa Ilkia ma wod pa Meculam, wod pa Jadok, wod pa Merayot, wod pa Akitub, ma en aye ladit maloyo Ot pa Lubanga; <verse eid="1CH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12" />ki Adaya wod pa Jerokam ma wod pa Packur, wod pa Malkija; ki Maacai wod pa Adiel ma wod pa Jakajera, wod pa Meculam, wod pa Mecilemit, wod pa Imer; <verse eid="1CH 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13" />kacel ki lukakagi bene ma gin ludito kaka i odi pa kwarigi, gin dano alip acel ki miya abiro ki pyere abicel. Gin jo makwiri tutwal ikom kit me tic i Ot pa Lubanga.<verse eid="1CH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulevi ma gubedo i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14" />Lulevi ma ceng gudwogo cen ma gubedo i Jerucalem gin aye Cemaya wod pa Kacub, ma wod pa Ajrikam, wod pa Kacabia, wod pa Merari; <verse eid="1CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15" />ki Bakbakar, Kerec, Galal, ki Matania wod pa Mika ma wod pa Jikri, wod pa Acap; <verse eid="1CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16" />ki Obadia wod pa Cemaya ma wod pa Galal, wod pa Jedutun; kacel ki Berekia wod pa Aca wod pa Elkana ma obedo ikin gangi pa jo Netopa.<verse eid="1CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17" />Lugwok dogola Ot pa Lubanga ma nongo gubedo i Jerucalem gin aye Calum, Akub, Talmon, Akiman ki lukakagi, ma Calum aye laditgi. <verse eid="1CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18" />Nio wa ikare meno onongo gubedo lugwok dogola Ot pa Lubanga ma Rwot wok ki iye, itung kunyango. Magi aye lugwok dogola gang pa Lulevi. <verse eid="1CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19" />Calum wod pa Kore, ma wod pa Ebiacap, wod pa Kora, kacel ki lukakagi ma i dog ot pa kwarogi, ma gin likwayo pa Kora, gin aye gubedo lugwok dog kema, kit macalo kwarigi yam gubedo ludito ma giloyo gony pa Rwot kun gigwoko dogola me donyo. <verse eid="1CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20" />Ikare macon onongo Finekaci wod pa Eleajar en aye obedo ladit ma loyogi; ci Rwot onongo tye kwede. <verse eid="1CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21" />Jekaria wod pa Mecelemia en aye onongo lagwok dogola ma donyo i Kema me Rwate. <verse eid="1CH 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22" />Jo magi ducu mayam kiyerogi me bedo lugwok dogola onongo gin romo dano miya aryo ki apar wiye aryo. Kicoyo nyinggi i buk me tekwarogi ki igangigi kama onongo yam gibedo iye. Nongo rwot Daudi ki Camuel ma lanebi aye yam gumoko kwarigi me bedo i dog tic man, pien gubedo dano ma kigenogi tutwal. <verse eid="1CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23" />Kitmeno gin ki likwayogi gubedo ludito tic maloyo dogola Ot pa Rwot, en aye ot me kema pa Rwot, kun gitiyo macalo lukurpiny. <verse eid="1CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24" />Lugwok dogola kiketogi i kabedo angwen, tung kunyango, tung kupotoceng, tung kumalo ki tung kupiny. <verse eid="1CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25" />Lukakagi ma i gangigi aye onongo gibino me leyo tic kun gikonye keken gi pi nino abiro ma giloke aloka kwedgi. <verse eid="1CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26" />Pien lugwok dogola madito onongo gibedo kunu kare ducu, gin aye Lulevi ma giloyo kicika odi matinone ki odi kano lim ma i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27" />Odi butugi orumu Ot pa Lubanga, pien tic me kuru piny obedo meggi, gin bene gigwoko layab me yabo ot odiko ki odiko.<verse eid="1CH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulevi mukene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28" />Jo mogo ikin gi onongo gigwoko jami ma kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Lubanga. Ikare ducu ma kidwokogi cen ki ma kikwanyogi woko, onongo gikwanogi. <verse eid="1CH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29" />Jo mukene ikin gi kiketogi me loyo jami ma bedo i Ot pa Lubanga, ki jami tic maleng ducu, dok giloyo bene moko kwon mapwote, ki kongo bwino, ki moo, ki odok eceta, ki angwece. <verse eid="1CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30" />Jo mukene ma gin lutino pa ajwaki giyubu jami me aruba pi angwece. <verse eid="1CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31" />Matitia, dano acel ma ikin Lulevi, ma en latin kayo pa Calum ma jo Kora, en aye obedo lalo tic me tedo mugati ma apadani, pien en dano ma gene. <verse eid="1CH 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32" />Lukakagi mogo ma gin jo Kokat giloyo mugati ma kiketo inyim Rwot; ticgi obedo me yubune Cabit ki Cabit.<verse eid="1CH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33" />Magi aye luwer, ma gin ludito kaka i odi pa kwarigi; yam gibutu i kicika odi ma tinone ma i Ot pa Lubanga, ma pe gitiyo tic mukene, pien yam gibedo i dog tic dyeceng ki dyewor. <verse eid="1CH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34" />Magi aye ludito kaka i odi pa kwarigi ma i kaka pa Lulevi, ma lubu yalwakgi, gin aye ludito mayam gibedo i Jerucalem.<verse eid="1CH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tekwaro pa Caulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 8:29-38">1 Tek 8:29-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35" />Jeyel ma won Gibeon yam bedo i Gibeon; nying dakone Maaka, <verse eid="1CH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36" />latin awobine me kayo en Abudon, ka dok Jur, Kic, Baal, Ner, Nadab, <verse eid="1CH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37" />Gedor, Akio, Jeker, ki Miklot; <verse eid="1CH 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38" />Miklot aye won Cimeam. Jo magi bene yam gubedo ma gukeme ki lukakagi ma gibedo i Jerucalem, kacel ki lukakagi. <verse eid="1CH 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39" />Ner onywalo Kic, Kic onywalo Caulo, Caulo onywalo Yonacan, Malkicua, Abinadab ki Ecibaal. <verse eid="1CH 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40" />Yonacan onywalo Meribaal, Meribaal onywalo Mika. <verse eid="1CH 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41" />Lutino awobe pa Mika gin aye Piton, Melek, Takrea ki Akaj. <verse eid="1CH 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42" />Akaj onywalo Jara, Jara onywalo Alemet, Ajimavet ki Jimri. Jimri onywalo Moja, <verse eid="1CH 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43" />Moja onywalo Binea; ma wode Repaya, ma wode Eleaca, ma wode Ajel. <verse eid="1CH 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44" />Ajel yam tye ki lutino awobe abicel, ma nyinggi ene: Ajrikam, Bokeru, Icmael, Cearia, Obadia ki Kanan. Jo magi aye lutino awobe pa Ajel.<verse eid="1CH 9:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10" />
  <para style="s1">To pa Caulo ki awobene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">1 Cam 31:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1" />Ikare meno jo Piliciti gulwenyo ikom jo Icrael. Ci jo Icrael guringo woko ki inyim jo Piliciti, ci kineko jo Icrael mapol iwi got Gilboa. <verse eid="1CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2" />Jo Piliciti guringo korgi gudingo kor Caulo ki awobene, ci guneko Yonacan, Abinadab ki Malkicua, ma gin ducu awobe pa Caulo. <verse eid="1CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3" />Lweny ogeto matek i kor Caulo, ci wegi atero gucele woko, guketo ret ikome. <verse eid="1CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4" />Ci Caulo owaco bot lating jami lwenye ni, “Wot pala lucwani woko, i coba kwede pil, wek jo ma pe kilirogini, ma gin pe ngeyo Lubanga pe gubin ikoma, koni miyo gibedo ki wayu me yomcwiny ikoma.” Ento lating jami lwenye pe oye, pien lworo omake matek, omiyo Caulo okwanyo pala lucwane kikome ci opoto ogure kwede kekene. <verse eid="1CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5" />Ka lating jami lwenye oneno ni Caulo dong oto woko, ci en bene opoto ogure kene ki pala lucwane, oto woko. <verse eid="1CH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6" />Kitmeno Caulo ki awobene adeki kacel ki jo me ode ducu, guto woko lawangacel ci pe obedo ki ma laloc. <verse eid="1CH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7" />Ka jo Icrael ducu ma onongo gibedo i nota me Jejreel guwinyo ni mony pa jo Icrael guringo woko, ki dok ni Caulo ki awobene kinekogi woko, ci guringo guweko taun gi woko; ci jo Piliciti gubino gucako bedo i taun gi magu ducu.<verse eid="1CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8" />Orwone jo Piliciti gubino ka lunyu bongi ki ikom jo ma kinekogi, ci gunongo kom Caulo ki kom awobene adeki ikom got Gilboa. <verse eid="1CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9" />Ci gulunyo jami lweny pa Caulo ki ikome, gucito kwede, wa ki wiye bene ma gutongo, ka gucwalo kwena oromo i lobo pa jo Piliciti ducu pi tero lok me yomcwiny bot jogigi ki bot lwakgi ducu. <verse eid="1CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10" />Guketo jami lweny pa Caulo i ot jogigi; ka dok guguro wiye i ot jok Dagon. <verse eid="1CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11" />Ento ka jo Jabec-gilead ducu guwinyo gin ma jo Piliciti gutimo ikom Caulo, <verse eid="1CH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12" />ci oteka lwenygi ducu gua, gukwanyo kom Caulo woko ki kom awobene, guterogi wa i Jabec. Ka guyiko cogogi ite yat kworo matye i Jabec, ci gurii kec pi nino abiro.<verse eid="1CH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:31">Lev 19:31</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:6">20:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 13:8-14">1 Cam 13:8-14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 15:1-24">15:1-24</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:7-8">28:7-8</ref></char>
    </note>Kitmeno Caulo oto pien pe obedo lagen; en onongo ongayo wang Rwot woko, pe otiyo gin ma Rwot ociko, dok bene owoto katyet bot lakor tipu pi yero nyime, <verse eid="1CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14" />ma pe dong openyo dog Rwot. Pieno omiyo Rwot oneke woko, ci okwanyo ker omiyo bot Daudi ma wod pa Yece.<verse eid="1CH 10:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi odoko rwot me Icrael kacel ki me Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:1-10">2 Cam 5:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1" />Lacen jo Icrael ducu gucoke bot Daudi i Kebron, ci guwaco ni, “Nen ba, wan aye wa cogo komi ki ringo komi. <verse eid="1CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2" />Ikare macon ca, wa ikare ma onongo Caulo aye rwot ma loyowa, in yam i telo wi jo Icrael ka gicito kalweny, dok i dwokowa paco bene, ci Rwot Lubangani bene nene owaco boti ni, ‘In aye i bibedo lakwa lwaka jo Icrael, dok in i bibedo laker ma loyogi.’” <verse eid="1CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3" />Kitmeno ludongo pa jo Icrael ducu gubino bot rwot i Kebron. Rwot Daudi oketo gicike kwedgi i Kebron inyim Rwot, ci guwiro Daudi obedo rwot maloyo jo Icrael, kit mayam Rwot oloko ki i dog Camuel.<verse eid="1CH 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi omayo got Cion</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 15:63">Yoc 15:63</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 1:21">Lung 1:21</ref></char>
    </note>Daudi ki jo Icrael ducu gucito i Jerucalem, ma en aye Jebuc, kalweny ikom jo Jebuc ma gibedo i lobo kunu. <verse eid="1CH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5" />Jo ma gibedo i Jebuc onongo guwaco bot Daudi ni, “In pe i bidonyo kany.” Ento Daudi ocito omayo gogo me Cion woko, ci odoko gang kale. <verse eid="1CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6" />Daudi owaco ni, “Dano ma bikwongo neko jo Jebuc, en aye bibedo ladit ma lawimony.” Ci Joab wod pa Ceruya ayee otelo wi mony okwongo tero monye kunu ci en odoko laditgi. <verse eid="1CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7" />Daudi ocako bedo i cel gogo, ma omiyo kilwongo ni, “Gang kal pa Daudi.” <verse eid="1CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8" />Daudi ogero taun madit orumu woko liking, cake ki i Millo. Joab ogero odi mukene ma i taun madit mayam obale. <verse eid="1CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9" />Daudi omede odoko dit tutwal, pien onongo Rwot me mony aye tye kwede.<verse eid="1CH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Twoni oteka lweny pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">2 Cam 23:8-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10" />Magi aye gin ludito ki ikin twoni oteka lweny pa Daudi, jo mayam gumiyo kony matek i kere, kacel ki jo Icrael ducu, ci guketo en me bedo rwot, kit ma onongo Rwot Lubanga yam oloko ikom Icrael. <verse eid="1CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11" />Man aye lok kom twoni oteka lweny pa Daudi: Jacobeam ma jo Kakmon en aye ladit pa jo adeki; en yam okato ki tonge ikom jo miya adek, ci onekogi woko ducu lawangacel. <verse eid="1CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12" />Ngat ma lubu en ki ikin twoni oteka lweny adeki en aye Eleajar wod pa Dodo ma jo Akoki. <verse eid="1CH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13" />En obedo kacel ki Daudi i Pac-dammim ikare ma jo Piliciti gucoke kalweny kunu. Poto onongo tye kunu ma cayiri ocek iye ma bup, ci lwak ocako ringo woko ki inyim jo Piliciti. <verse eid="1CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14" />Ento en ocamo co ci ocung i dye poto pi laro jo Icrael, ci ocako neko jo Piliciti, ci Rwot olarogi ki loc madit tutwal.<verse eid="1CH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15" />Jo adek ki ikin ludito pyere adeki gulor piny wa i got kama Daudi bedo iye i boro Adullam; onongo mony pa jo Piliciti ogony i nota Repaim. <verse eid="1CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16" />I karenu onongo Daudi tye i ka kanene, ki cel gogo pa Lupiliciti onongo tye i Beterekem. <verse eid="1CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17" />Daudi oloko ki miti madwong ni, “Kono ngat mo ocito otwomo pii ki iwang it me Beterekem matye cok ki dog gang ca, ci omiya amato, kono ber mada!” <verse eid="1CH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18" />Ci twoni oteka lweny adeki gucito gubaro dye gony pa jo Piliciti, gutwomo pii ki iwang it ma i Beterekem matye cok ki dog gang ca, ci gukelo bot Daudi. Ento Daudi pe omato; otingo oliyo piny inyim Rwot pi gityer amata, <verse eid="1CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19" />kun waco ni, “Pe obed kumeno ki inyim Lubangana, an pe myero atim kit man. An aye dok amato remo pa joni? Pien gukelo pii pi dyero komgi.” En aye lok ma omiyo pe omato pii meno. Magi aye gin madito ma twoni oteka lweny adeki yam gutimo.<verse eid="1CH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20" />Abicai omin Joab onongo ladit ikin jo pyere adeki. Otingo tonge olwenyo ikom jo miya adek ci onekogi woko ducu, ma omiyo nyinge oywek ma mito rom arom ki pa jo adek ca. <verse eid="1CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21" />Pieno Abicai olimo yweka madit ki ikom jo pyere adeki, ci odoko ladit wi monygi; ento pe olimo rwom pa jo adek ca.<verse eid="1CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22" />Ki Benaya wod pa Yekoyada obedo twon oteka ma i Kabjeel, latim gin madito; en oneko awobe aryo ma gin twoni labwor me Moab. En bene olor odonyo i bur ci oneko iye labwor ikare ma pee ocwer mapek. <verse eid="1CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23" />Ka dok oneko Laejipt mo, dano ma kome pek ma bore romo puti abiro ki nucu. Laejipt meno onongo tye ki tonge i cinge marom ki rii yat lacwe bongo; ento en Benaya ocito bote ki odoone, ci oyutu tong woko ki i cing Laejipt, ka oneke kwede woko ki tongenu. <verse eid="1CH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24" />Benaya wod pa Yekoyada otimo gin madito kitmeno, omiyo nyinge olimo yweka madit ma mito rom aroma ki pa twoni oteka lweny adeki. <verse eid="1CH 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25" />Nyinge oywek ikin jo pyere adeki, ento pe olimo rwom pa jo adek ca. Daudi oketo en obedo ladit pa jo ma gwoko en rwot.<verse eid="1CH 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26" />Twoni oteka lweny ma ikin lumony gin aye Acael ma omin Joab, Elkanan wod pa Dodo me Beterekem, <verse eid="1CH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27" />Camot me Karod, Kelej ma jo Palti, <verse eid="1CH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28" />Ira wod pa Ikec me Tekoa, Abiejer me Anatot, <verse eid="1CH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29" />Cibekai ma Lakucat, Ilai ma jo Akoki, <verse eid="1CH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30" />Makarai me Netopa, Keled wod pa Baana me Netopa, <verse eid="1CH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31" />Itai wod pa Ribai me Gibea pa jo Benjamin, Benaya me Piraton, <verse eid="1CH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32" />Kurai ma bedo i nota ora me Gaac, Abiel me Arba, <verse eid="1CH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33" />Ajimavet me Bakarum, Eliaba me Caalbon, <verse eid="1CH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34" />Kacem ma jo Gijon, Yonacan wod pa Cage ma jo Karar, <verse eid="1CH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35" />Akiam wod pa Cakar ma jo Karar, Elipal wod pa Ur, <verse eid="1CH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36" />Keper ma jo Mekerat, Akija ma jo Pelon, <verse eid="1CH 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37" />Kejero me Karmel, Naarai wod pa Ejibai, <verse eid="1CH 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38" />Joel omin Natan, Mibkar wod pa Agri, <verse eid="1CH 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39" />Jelek ma jo Ammon, Nakarai me Beerot ma lating jami lweny pa Joab wod pa Jeruya, <verse eid="1CH 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40" />Ira ma jo Itri, Gareb ma jo Itri, <verse eid="1CH 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41" />Uria ma jo Kit, Jabad wod pa Aklai, <verse eid="1CH 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42" />Adina wod pa Cija ma jo pa Reuben, ma ladit ikin jo pa Reuben, en aye obedo ki jone pyere adek bene; <verse eid="1CH 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43" />Kanan wod pa Maaka ki Yocapat ma jo Mitan, <verse eid="1CH 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44" />Ujia ma jo Acitera, Camma ki Jeyel ma awobe pa Ketam me Aroer, <verse eid="1CH 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45" />Jediael wod pa Cimri ki omine Joka, ma Latiji, <verse eid="1CH 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46" />Eliel ma jo Makavi, ki Jeribai ki Jocavia ma awobe pa Elnaam, ki Itima ma jo Moab, <verse eid="1CH 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47" />Eliel ki Obed, ki Jaciel ma jo Mejoba.<verse eid="1CH 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lukony Daudi i Jiklag</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1" />Daudi oringo ayela pa rwot Caulo wod pa Kic ci ocito wa Jiklag. Ikare ma en tye kunu, jo ma gin twoni oteka lweny ma gubedo kakonye i lweny gubino bote. <verse eid="1CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2" />Gin wegi atum, mayam gicelo atero nyo gibayo kidi ki cinggi ma lacuc onyo ma lacam. Gin onongo jo pa Benjamin, ma i kaka pa Caulogi. <verse eid="1CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3" />Laditgi obedo Akiejer, ka dok Yoaci gin aryo ducu lutino pa Cema me Gibea; ka dok Jejiel ki Pelet ma awobe pa Ajimavet; ki Beraka, Yeko me Anatot. <verse eid="1CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4" />Icmaya me Gibeon, twon oteka ma ikin jo pyere adek ca, dok en ladit ma loyogi. Gin aye Jeremia, Jakajiel, Yokanan, Jojabed me Gedera, <verse eid="1CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5" />Elujai, Jerimot, Bealia, Cemaria, Cepatia ma jo Karup; <verse eid="1CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6" />Elkana, Icia, Ajarel, Joejer ki Jacobeam, ma gin jo pa Kora, <verse eid="1CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7" />ki Joela ki Jebadia, ma gin awobe pa Jerokam me Gedor.<verse eid="1CH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oteka lweny ma gua ki i kaka pa Gad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8" />Oteka ma gin ongiyo ki lweny ma ikin jo pa Gad gugware gucito bot Daudi i ka kanene ma i tim. Oyita lweny ma gingeyo lweny ki kwot ki tong, ma wanggi nen calo wang labwor, ma gidwir calo til ma i godi. <verse eid="1CH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9" />Gin aye: Ejer ma laditgi, me aryone Obadia, me adeke Eliab, <verse eid="1CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10" />me angwene Micimana, me abice Jeremia, <verse eid="1CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11" />me abicele Atai, me abirone Eliel, <verse eid="1CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12" />me aborone Yokanan, me abongwene Elijabad, <verse eid="1CH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13" />me apare Jeremia, me apar wiye acele Makibanai. <verse eid="1CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14" />Jo Gad magi ducu gin ludito maloyo mony; ludito matinone giloyo jo miya, ki maditone loyo jo alip. <verse eid="1CH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15" />Magi gin aye jo mayam gungolo Jordan i dwe mukwongo, ikare ma onongo piine opong woko libyeny nio wa i tura ci guryemo jo ma gitye i nota ducu, ma tung kunyango ki tung kupotoceng.<verse eid="1CH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oteka lweny ma gua ki i kaka pa Benjamin ki Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16" />Ka dok jo pa Benjamin mogo, ki pa Juda, gubino bot Daudi i ka kanene. <verse eid="1CH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17" />Daudi okato woko kajolo wigi, kun waco botgi ni, “Kace wubino bota ki cwiny me wat pi konya, ci abibedo kwedwu ki yomcwiny. Ento kace wubino kaumu wanga wek wumiya bot lumeroka, kadi bed an cwinya leng, ci Lubanga pa kwariwa myero onen ci ongol gire kop ma opore.” <verse eid="1CH 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18" />Ci Cwiny pa Lubanga obino ikom Amacai, ma en aye ladit pa jo pyere adek ca, ci ocako owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">“Wan wa lwaki, in Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">wabibedo kwedi, in wod pa Yece.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">Kuc, kuc obed kwedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">kuc bene obed ikom lukony in!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">Pien Lubangani aye tye kakonyi.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 12:18">Ka Daudi ojologi, ci oketogi gubedo ludito me buca monye.<verse eid="1CH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oteka lweny ma gua ki i kaka pa Manace</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19" />Jo pa Manace mogo guloke tung bot Daudi ikare ma obino ki jo Piliciti kalweny ikom Caulo. Kadi bed kumeno en pe omedo ki konyogi pien ludito pa jo Piliciti guyubu lok ikome, ci guryeme woko, kun giwaco ni, “Kace en biloke dok bot ladite Caulo, ci dong wato woko.” <verse eid="1CH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20" />Jo pa Manace ma gudonyo bote ikare ma en cito i Jiklag gin ene: Adina, Jojabad, Jediael, Mikael, Jojabad, Eliu ki Jiletai, ma gin aye onongo ludito maloyo wi jo alip ki i Manace. <verse eid="1CH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21" />Gukonyo Daudi ki lweny ikom buca mony pa luyak; pien onongo gin ducu twoni oteka lweny ma ludito me mony. <verse eid="1CH 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22" />Dano gubedo kabino kakonyo Daudi nino ki nino, nio ka gudoko cwar min mony madit, marom ki mony pa Lubanga.<verse eid="1CH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mony ma Daudi obedo kwede i Kebron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23" />Magi gin aye wel dul buca mony mayam gubino ki gilweny i cinggi bot Daudi i Kebron pi dwoko ker pa Caulo i cing Daudi, kit mayam Rwot owaconi. <verse eid="1CH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24" />Jo pa Juda ma wegi kwot ki tong onongo giromo alip abicel ki miya aboro ma kimiyo jami lweny i cinggi pi lweny. <verse eid="1CH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25" />Ki jo pa Cimon ma twoni oteka lweny alip abiro ki miya acel. <verse eid="1CH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26" />Jo pa Levi alip angwen ki miya abicel. <verse eid="1CH 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27" />Ka dok Yekoyada maloyo jo me ot pa Aron obino ki jo alip adek ki miya abiro. <verse eid="1CH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28" />Jadok latin awobi ma twon oteka obino ki ludito wi mony pyere aryo wiye aryo ma i dog ot pa wone kikome. <verse eid="1CH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29" />Jo pa Benjamin ma lukaka pa Caulo bene gubino maromo alip adek; jo mapol ki ikomgi yam kong gubedo kacwako kor ot pa Caulo nio wa ikare meno. <verse eid="1CH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30" />Jo pa Epraim gubino maromo alip pyere aryo ki miya aboro, ma gin oteka lweny ma nyinggi oywek i dog odi pa kwarogi. <verse eid="1CH 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31" />Jo ma i nucu kaka pa Manace gubino maromo jo alip aboro ma kiyerogi ki nyinggi wek gubin kaketo Daudi obed rwot. <verse eid="1CH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32" />Jo pa Icakar, jo ma onongo gingeyo kare dok gingeyo gin ma myero Icrael otii, bene gubino ki ludito miya aryo ki lukakagi ducu ma ite locgi. <verse eid="1CH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33" />Jo pa Jabulon bene gubino ki jo ma gunyebe ki lweny maromo alip pyere abic, ma guruke pi lweny ki jami lwenygi ducu pi konyo Daudi ki cwinygi acel. <verse eid="1CH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34" />Jo pa Naputali bene gubino ki ludito wi mony maromo alip acel ma gitye ki danogi alip pyere adek wiye abiro ma gutingo kwot ki tong. <verse eid="1CH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35" />Jo pa Dan bene gubino ki jo alip pyere aryo wiye aboro ki miya abicel ma guyube pi lweny. <verse eid="1CH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36" />Jo pa Acer bene gubino ki jo ma gunyebe ki lweny maromo alip pyere angwen, ma dong guyube pi lweny. <verse eid="1CH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37" />Jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace ma gua loka Jordan bene gubino maromo jo alip miya acel ki pyere aryo ma guruke ki jami lwenygi ducu.<verse eid="1CH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38" />Lulweny magi ducu gurwayo ma guryeyo ki kore, gubino kwede wa i Kebron ki cwiny mukemo keto Daudi rwot maloyo Icrael ducu. Kitmeno jo Icrael ducu mudonge gubedo ki cwiny acel me keto Daudi obed rwot. <verse eid="1CH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39" />Ci gubedo ki Daudi kunu pi nino adek kun gicamo, gimato bene, pien onongo utmegigi gutyeko yube pirgi. <verse eid="1CH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40" />Dok jo ma gicok kwedgi bene, ma gua wa ki i lobo Icakar ki Jabulon ki Naputali gucom ki cam ma guketo iwi kana, kinaga, kana madito ki twoni pur; ma gukelo lwak moko kwon madwong, ki pok otini, ki dog tuga olok mutwone, ki kongo bwino, ki moogu, ki twoni ki romi, pien onongo yomcwiny tye i Icrael.<verse eid="1CH 12:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi ocito kaomo Canduk me Gicike nia ki i Kiriat Jearim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:1-11">2 Cam 6:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1" />Daudi yam oyubu lok ki ludito maloyo buca mony me jo alip ki buca mony me jo miya, ki ludito ma i dul acel acel. <verse eid="1CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2" />Ci Daudi oloko ki i kacoke pa jo Icrael ducu kun waco ni, “Kace bedo ber botwu, ma Rwot Lubangawa bene mito, ci wacwalu kwena orom kin utmegiwa ma gudong i lobo Icrael ducu, kacel ki ajwaki ki Lulevi ma i taun ma gitye ki lobo me kakwatgi, wek gubin gucoke kacel botwa. <verse eid="1CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3" />Ci wek dong wakelu Canduk pa Lubangawa botwa, pien ikare pa Caulo yam watenyo woko ata.” <verse eid="1CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4" />Ci kacoke ducu oyeni kitim kitmeno, pien loke onen atir bot lwak ducu. <verse eid="1CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 7:1-2">1 Cam 7:1-2</ref></char></note>Ci Daudi ocoko jo Icrael ducu cake ki i Cikor ma iwang lobo me Ejipt nio wa i yoo ma donyo i Kamat, pi kelo Canduk me Gicike ki i Kiriat-jearim. <verse eid="1CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Nia 25:22</ref></char></note>Daudi ki jo Icrael ducu gucito i Baala, ma en aye Kiriat-jearim matye i Juda, kaomo Canduk me Gicike woko ki kunu, en aye Canduk ma kilwongo ki nying Rwot ma bedo iwi komker malo ka wi lukerubi. <verse eid="1CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7" />Ci gutingo Canduk me Gicike iwi gadigadi manyen, gukelo woko nia ki i ot pa Abinadab, ci Uja ki Akio gubedo kaleko twoni ma ywayo gadigadi. <verse eid="1CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8" />Daudi ki jo Icrael ducu gubedo kayare ki myel ki yomcwiny inyim Lubanga ki kero komgi ducu, ki wero wergu, ki goyo opuk, nanga, ajaa, atego agoya ki kutu tum.<verse eid="1CH 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9" />Ka guo i laro moyo pa Kidon, Uja ocwalo cinge pi mako kom Canduk, pien onongo twoni gucato. <verse eid="1CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10" />Ci kiniga omako Rwot ikom Uja, ci oneke woko pien onongo oketo cinge ikom Canduk; ci en oto woko kunu inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11" />Ci kiniga omako Daudi, pien Rwot otuge ikom Uja; ma omiyo kabedo meno kilwongo ni Perej-uja nio wa onyo. <verse eid="1CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12" />Daudi obedo ki lworo ikom Lubanga inino meno; kun waco ni, “Abitero Canduk me Gicike wa paco bota ningning?” <verse eid="1CH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13" />Kitmeno omiyo Daudi pe otero Canduk wa i gangkal pa Daudi, ento ongak kwede woko i ot pa Obed-edom ma jo Gat. <verse eid="1CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:4-5">1 Tek 26:4-5</ref></char></note>Canduk me Gicike obedo i ot pa Obed-edom pi dwe adek; ci Rwot omiyo gum bot Obed-edom ki jone ducu.<verse eid="1CH 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14" />
  <para style="s1">Tic ma Daudi otiyo i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:11-16">2 Cam 5:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1" />Kiram rwot me Turo yam ocwalo kwena bot Daudi, kun miyo bao yat cedar ki lupaa godi bene ki lupaa bao me gero ot pa Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2" />Omiyo Daudi oniang ni Rwot otyeko moko en me bedo rwot maloyo Icrael, dok ni otyeko miyo kere obedo ki deyo madwong pi pilo wi jone jo Icrael.<verse eid="1CH 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3" />Daudi dok omede ki nyomo mon i Jerucalem, ci onywalo awobe ki anyira mukene. <verse eid="1CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4" />Magi aye nying lutino ma Daudi onywalogi i Jerucalem. Camua, Cobab, Natan, Solomon, <verse eid="1CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5" />Ibar, Elicua, Elpelet, <verse eid="1CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6" />Noga, Nepeg, Japia, <verse eid="1CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7" />Elicama. Beeliada ki Elipelet.<verse eid="1CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi oloyo jo Piliciti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">2 Cam 5:17-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8" />Ka jo Piliciti guwinyo ni Daudi dong kityeko wire odoko rwot maloyo jo Icrael ducu, ci lumonygi ducu gucito kamako Daudi; ento Daudi owinyo pirgi, ci okato woko kalweny ikomgi. <verse eid="1CH 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9" />Onongo jo Piliciti gubino gumonyo nota Repaim. <verse eid="1CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10" />Ci Daudi ocako penyo dog Lubanga ni, “Ber acit kalweny ikom jo Piliciti? Ci i bimiyogi i cinga?” Ci Rwot ogamo doge ni, “Citi, abimiyogi i cingi.” <verse eid="1CH 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11" />Daudi ocito wa i Baal-perajim, ci oloyogi ki kunu, ci owaco ni, “Lubanga otyeko loyo lumerok woko kun wok ki i cinga, macalo lalele mucore.” Ma omiyo nying kabedo meno kilwongo ni, Baal-perajim. <verse eid="1CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12" />Jo Piliciti guringo gutenyo cal jogigi ingegi, ci Daudi omiyo twero me wangogi woko.<verse eid="1CH 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13" />Jo Piliciti dok gudwogo gumonyo nota meno. <verse eid="1CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14" />Ka Daudi dok openyo dog Lubanga, ci Lubanga ogamo ni, “Pe i bicito ikomgi atir. Wot i man ngegi ci ipot ikomgi ki kama okemo yadi owak. <verse eid="1CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15" />Kace iwinyo kor tyen dano ma gitye kawot lirukruk ma winye wa iwi yadi owak, ci dong i cit kalweny, pien nongo an Lubanga dong atelo nyimwu pi neko mony pa jo Piliciti woko.” <verse eid="1CH 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16" />Ci Daudi otiyo kit ma Lubanga ocike kwede, ci guneko mony pa jo Piliciti nia ki i Gibeon nio wa i Gejer. <verse eid="1CH 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17" />Ci nying Daudi oywek oromo i lobo ducu, ci Rwot omiyo lworo omako rok ducu ikom Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 14:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yube me kobo Canduk me Gicike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:12-22">2 Cam 6:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1" />Daudi ogero odine i taun madit pa Daudi, ci oyubu kabedo pi Canduk me Gicike, ocako guru kema pire. <verse eid="1CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:8">Nwo 10:8</ref></char></note> Ci Daudi owaco ni, “Dano mukene pe bitingo Canduk me Gicike, ento Lulevi keken, pien Rwot yam oyerogi pi tingo Canduk pa Rwot ki pi tic bote matwal.”<verse eid="1CH 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3" />Daudi olwongo jo Icrael ducu i Jerucalem, pi kelo Canduk pa Rwot i kabedone ma en oyubu pire. <verse eid="1CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4" />Ci Daudi olwongo likwayo pa Aron ki Lulevi kacel. <verse eid="1CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5" />Ikin likwayo pa Kokat ma Lalevi gin ene: Uriel ma laditgi, kacel ki utmegine miya acel ki pyere aryo; <verse eid="1CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6" />ikin likwayo pa Merari, Acaya ma laditgi, kacel ki utmegine miya aryo ki pyere aryo; <verse eid="1CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7" />ikin likwayo pa Gercon, Joel ma laditgi, kacel ki utmegine miya acel ki pyere adek; <verse eid="1CH 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8" />ikin likwayo pa Elicapan, Cemaya ma laditgi, kacel ki utmegine miya aryo; <verse eid="1CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9" />ikin likwayo pa Kebron, Eliel ma laditgi, kacel ki utmegine pyere aboro; <verse eid="1CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10" />ikin likwayo pa Ujiel, Aminadab ma laditgi, ki utmegine miya acel ki apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11" />Daudi dok olwongo ajwaki pa Lubanga Jadok ki Abiatar, ki Lulevi magi: Uriel, Acaya, Joel, Cemaya, Eliel ki Aminadab, <verse eid="1CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12" />ci Daudi owaco botgi ni, “Wun aye ludito kaka ma i dog odi pa kwarowu ma jo pa Levi; wulonye kekenwu wubed maleng, wun kacel ki utmegiwu, wek wukel Canduk pa Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, i kabedo ma atyeko yubune pire. <verse eid="1CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13" />Ikare mukwongo ca Rwot Lubanga otuge ikomwa ki kiniga ci opwodowa, pien pe wun aye nongo myero wutingo ikare meno, pien onongo pe wa penyo doge ikit ma Cik mito.” <verse eid="1CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14" />Kitmeno ajwaki pa Lubanga ki Lulevi gulonye keken gi pi kelo Canduk pa Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="1CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:14">Nia 25:14</ref></char></note>Pieno Lulevi gucako tingo Canduk me Gicike, gulebo ki tale iwi gwokgi, kit mayam Moses ocikogi kwede, macalo Rwot owaco.<verse eid="1CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16" />Daudi dok ociko ludito pa Lulevi pi yero utmegigi wek gubed luwer ma gibigoyo jami wer malongo; nanga ki opuk ki atego agoyagu, dok bene me wer ki dwon malongo ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="1CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17" />Kitmeno Lulevi gucako yero Eman wod pa Joel, ka dok Acap wod pa Berekia ki ikin utmegine. Ikin likwayo pa Merari guyero utmegigi magi, Etan wod pa Kucaya; <verse eid="1CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18" />ka dok guyero utmegigi ma i dul me aryo, gin aye Jekaria, Jajiel, Cemiramot, Jekiel, Uni, Eliab, Benaya, Maaceya, Matitia, Elipeleku ki Mikneya, ki lugwok dogola Obed-edom ki Jeyel. <verse eid="1CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19" />Luwer magi Eman, Acap ki Etan ticgi obedo me goyo atego mola; <verse eid="1CH 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20" />Jekaria, Ajiel, Cemiramot, Jekiel, Uni, Eliab, Maaceya ki Benaya ticgi obedo me goyo nanga ikit me Alamot; <verse eid="1CH 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21" />ento Matitia, Elipeleku, Mikneya, Obed-edom, Jeyel ki Ajajia gin ticgi obedo me telo wer ki opuk ikit me Ceminit. <verse eid="1CH 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22" />Kenania, ma en aye latelwer pa Lulevi, tice me nyutu kit me wer pien en onongo ladiro i wer. <verse eid="1CH 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23" />Berekia ki Elkana yam gin lugwok dogola me Canduk me Gicike. <verse eid="1CH 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24" />Cebania, Jocapat, Netanel, Amacai, Jekaria, Benaya ki Eleajar, ma gin ducu ajwaki pa Lubanga, ticgi me kutu tum inyim Canduk me Gicike, Obed-edom ki Jekia gin bene gubedo lugwok dogola me Canduk me Gicike.<verse eid="1CH 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kitero Canduk me Gicike i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25" />Kitmeno Daudi ki ludongo pa jo Icrael, ki ludito mony maloyo jo alip, gucako wot me cito kaomo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot nia ki i ot pa Obed-edom ma cwinygi yom matek. <verse eid="1CH 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26" />Gutumu twoni abiro ki nyogi romi abiro, wek Lubanga okony Lulevi ma gutingo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot. <verse eid="1CH 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27" />Daudi onongo oruke ki jor me camanini mabere, kit macalo Lulevi ducu ma gutingo Canduk me Gicike bene guruke, kacel ki luwer, ki Kenana ma latelwer pa luwer ducu. Daudi onongo otweyo pyere ki epod me camanini. <verse eid="1CH 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28" />Ci jo Icrael ducu gukelo Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot kitmeno, ma giwayo ma rwate ki koko bila, koko tum, ki koko atego agoyagu, kun giwero ki nanga ki opukgu malongo.<verse eid="1CH 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29" />Ka Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot obino wa i gangkal pa Daudi, ci Mikal ma nya pa Caulo obolo wange woko ki iwang dirica oneno rwot Daudi ka myelo ma cwinye yom, ci obedo kacayo Daudi ki i cwinye.<verse eid="1CH 15:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1" />Gukelo Canduk me Gicike wa i paco, ci gucibo i kema ma Daudi oyubu pire; ka gucako tyero gitum awanga ki gityer me berbedo inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2" />Ka Daudi otyeko tyero gitum awangagu ki gityer me berbedo, ci olamo gum ikom lwak i nying Rwot. <verse eid="1CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3" />Lacen ocako poko jami ki jo Icrael ducu, co wa ki mon; kun dano acel acel kimiye mugati acel, ki ringo angida, ki poki olok mutwone.<verse eid="1CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4" />Dok oketo Lulevi mogo pi bedo lutic inyim Canduk me Gicike, pi koro nying Lubanga, ki pi pwoyo en ki me pako Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="1CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5" />Acap aye laditgi, ki me aryone ngat malube obedo Jekaria, Jeyel, Cemiramot, Jekiel, Matitia, Eliab, Benaya, Obed-edom ki Jeyel, gin aye lugo nanga ki opuk. Acap onongo goyo atego agoya, <verse eid="1CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6" />ki Benaya ki Jakajiel ma ajwaki pa Lubanga gin aye lukut tum teretere inyim Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot. <verse eid="1CH 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7" />Ikare meno en aye nino ma Daudi okwongo ciko ni Acap ki utmegine gubed kawero wer me pwoyo Rwot.<verse eid="1CH 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wer me pwoc pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 105:1-15">Jab 105:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:1-13">96:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 106:47-48">47-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8" />Wumii pwoc bot Rwot, wulwong nyinge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:8">wumii tice ma en otiyo ongene i rok ducu!<verse eid="1CH 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9" />Wuwer bote wer me pako en,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:9">wutit bene pi tice me aura ducu!<verse eid="1CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10" />Wuket deyo ikom nyinge maleng;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:10">jo ma yenyo Rwot cwinygi obed yom!<verse eid="1CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11" />Wubin bot Rwot wek wunong teko ki bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:11">wubed inyime nakanaka.<verse eid="1CH 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12" />Wupo ikom tic me aura ma en ceng otiyo ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:12">ginaura mayam otiyo ki kop ma ongolo,<verse eid="1CH 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:13" />wun likwayo pa Abraim mayam latice,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:13">wun lutino pa Yakobo ma en oyerowu.<verse eid="1CH 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14" />En aye Rwot Lubangawa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:14">kop ma en ongolo oromo wi lobo ducu.<verse eid="1CH 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15" />Wupo ikom gicikene ma bedo ri nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:15">ikom lok mayam en ociko, pi yalwak alip ki alip,<verse eid="1CH 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:7">Aca 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref></char>
    </note>en gicike ma oketo ki Abraim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:16">ki lok mayam en okwongo ki Icaka,<verse eid="1CH 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 28:13">Aca 28:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>ma omoko odoko cik bot Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:17">wek obed gicike ki Icrael matwal,<verse eid="1CH 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18" />kun waco ni, “Abimiyo lobo Kanaan botwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:18">obed lobo me aleyawu.”<verse eid="1CH 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19" />Ikare ma pud gin nok, ma welgi tidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:19">ma pud gin lubedo i lobo meno,<verse eid="1CH 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20" />ma giwire ikin lobo mapatpat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:20">ite ker bene mapatpat.<verse eid="1CH 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 20:3-7">Aca 20:3-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lubanga pe oye ngati mo odiyogi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:21">ojuku luker mapol pirgi kun waco ni,<verse eid="1CH 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22" />“Pe wugud kom jo ma an awirogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:22">pe wutim lunebina marac!”<verse eid="1CH 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23" />Wuwer bot Rwot, wun lobo ducu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:23">Wutit pi lar ma mere nino ducu.<verse eid="1CH 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24" />Wutuc deyone bot lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:24">wutit tice me aura bot rok ducu!<verse eid="1CH 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25" />Rwot aye dit, myero kipake tutwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:25">myero kilwore makato lubanga mukenegu ducu.<verse eid="1CH 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26" />Pien lubanga pa rok ducu gin gubedo cal jogi apaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:26">ento Rwot aye oketo polo.<verse eid="1CH 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27" />Deyo ki dit tye bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:27">tek ki yomcwiny tye kama en bedo iye.<verse eid="1CH 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28" />Wun kaka me rok ducu, wumii deyo bot Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:28">wumii deyo ki tek bot Rwot!<verse eid="1CH 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29" />Wumii deyo bot Rwot muporo nyinge;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:29">wukel gityer, wubin wa inyime!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:29">Wuwor Rwot pien en opore me awora;<verse eid="1CH 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30" />komwu myero omyel inyime, wun lobo ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:30">i ada, lobo bene ocung matek ma pe yenge.<verse eid="1CH 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31" />In polo bed ki yomcwiny ki lobo bene obed ma cwinye yom!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:31">Wuwac ikin rok ni, “Rwot tye laloc!”<verse eid="1CH 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32" />Wek nam omor, ki gin acweya ducu matye iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:32">poto bene oum, ki jami ducu matye iye!<verse eid="1CH 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33" />Yadi ma i bunga ducu gibiwer ki yomcwiny inyim Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:33">pien en obibino kangolo kop ikom lobo.<verse eid="1CH 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Tek 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Eji 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Jab 100:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jer 33:11</ref></char>
    </note>Wumii pwoc bot Rwot, pien en ber;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:34">mar mere ma pe loke bedo nakanaka!<verse eid="1CH 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35" />Wuwac bene ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">“Larwa, Ai Lubanga lalarwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">i cokwa ci i larwa ki ikin lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">wek wapwo nyingi maleng, waum ka wapaki.<verse eid="1CH 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36" />Kipwo Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:36">nia con ki con nio nino ma pe tum!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CH 16:36" />
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:36">Lwak ducu gugamo ni, “Amen!” Ci gupako Rwot.<verse eid="1CH 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiketo Lulevi pi tic ikom Canduk me Gicike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37" />Daudi oweko ki Acap ki utmegine me bedo katic inyim Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot wek gubed katiyo kunu matwal inyim Canduk me Gicike kit ma mite kwede inino acel acel. <verse eid="1CH 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38" />Ka dok Obed-edom wod pa Jedutun, ki utmegine pyere abicel wiye aboro, ki Koca gin gubedo lugwok dogola.<verse eid="1CH 16:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39" />Daudi oweko ni Jadok ajwaka pa Lubanga ki utmegine ma gin ajwaki pa Lubanga inyim kema pa Rwot i ka woro Lubanga iwi got matye i Gibeon. <verse eid="1CH 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40" />Odiko ki otyeno omyero gin otim gitum awanga bot Rwot iwi keno tyer me gitum awanga, kun gilubu lok ducu ma kicoyo i Cik pa Rwot mayam ociko ki jo Icrael. <verse eid="1CH 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41" />Eman ki Jedutun gunywako tic kwedgi, kacel ki jo mukene mayam kiyerogi ki nyinggi pi miyo pwoc bot Rwot pi mar mere ma bedo nakanaka. <verse eid="1CH 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42" />Eman ki Jedutun onongo gitye ki tum ki atego agoya pi wer agoya, ki jami agoya mukene ma gigoyo ikare me wero wer maleng. Lutino awobe pa Jedutun yam kiketogi pi gwoko dogola Ot pa Rwot.<verse eid="1CH 16:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:43: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 6:19-20">2 Cam 6:19-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci lwak ducu guket, dano acel acel odok i ode, ki Daudi bene odok i pacone kalamo gum ikom jone.<verse eid="1CH 16:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga oketo gicike ki Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">2 Cam 7:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1" />Ikare ma onongo Daudi dong obedo ki i ode, en ocwalo olwongo lanebi Natan ci ocako waco bote ni, “Nen ba, an dong abedo i ot bao cedar, ento Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot pud bedo i kema.” <verse eid="1CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2" />Ci Natan odok iye ki Daudi ni, “Tim gin ducu matye i cwinyi, pien Lubanga tye kwedi.”<verse eid="1CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3" />Ento i dyewor meno acelu lok pa Rwot dok obino bot Natan ni, <verse eid="1CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4" />“Cit icitit bot latica Daudi ni Rwot owaco kuman ni, ‘In pe ibigera ot me bedo. <verse eid="1CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5" />Pien peya abedo i ot mo nia wa ikare ma alaro jo Icrael ki Ejipt dok atelo wigi nio kwede wa onyo, ento abedo ka kobo nia ki i kema man nio wa i kema mukene, ki nia ki i kabedo man nio wa i kabedo mukene. <verse eid="1CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6" />Ikabedo ducu ma abedo kawire iye ki jo Icrael ducu, an mono yam kong aloko lok mo bot lungolkop me Icrael mayam acikogi pi kwayo lwaka kun awaco ni, pingo pe kong wugera ot mo me bao cedar? <verse eid="1CH 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7" />Koni dong ibiwaco ki latica Daudi ni, Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, an yam akwanyi ki kakwat i olet, kama ibedo kaleko iye romi, wek i bed laker maloyo jona jo Icrael; <verse eid="1CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8" />dok abedo kalonge kwedi i kabedo ma icito iye ducu, abedo kajwero lumeroki woko ki inyimi. Dok abimiyo nyingi ywek, marom ki nying jo madito ma iwi loboni. <verse eid="1CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9" />Dok abimiyo kabedo ki jona jo Icrael; ci abiketogi iye, wek dong gubed i kabedogi kikome, ma pe dong kibiyelogi matwal, wa lulweny magwa bene pe dok bipoto ikomgi, kit macalo ikare ma con ca. <verse eid="1CH 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10" />Nia wa ikare ma con ma aketo lungolkop ma guloyo jona jo Icrael; ci gutayo lumerokgi woko ducu. Ento atuci ni, Rwot bimiyo odi bedo madit. <verse eid="1CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11" />Ka kareni oromo me yweyo kacel ki kwarini, ci abiketo wodi mo ma bilubi bedo dit, ci abimoko kere bedo matek. <verse eid="1CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12" />En aye bigera ot, an abimoko komkere bedo matwal. <verse eid="1CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:18">2 Kor 6:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:5">Ibru 1:5</ref></char></note>Abibedo wone, ki en bibedo woda; pe abikwanyo mar mera ma pe loke ki ikome, kit mayam akwanyo ki ikom ngat ma otelo nyimini. <verse eid="1CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14" />Ento abimoko en i oda ki i kera matwal; ki komker mere bene dong bimoko matwal.’” <verse eid="1CH 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15" />Ci Natan otito bot Daudi lok magi ducu, ki kit ginanyuta ma onen bote ducu.<verse eid="1CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lega me pwoc pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:18-29">2 Cam 7:18-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16" />Lacen Rwot Daudi ocito obedo piny wa inyim Rwot, ci owaco ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga, an anga, oda kono gin ango, ma omiyo ikonya nio wa onyooni? <verse eid="1CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17" />Pud i bwono kony man ni tidi ki tung boti, Ai Lubanga; ibedo kalok ikom oda ki kit ma bibedo kwede pi kare ma lac matye anyim, dok i nyuta bene likwaya ma anyim, ai Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18" />An Daudi dok abiwaco kit lok ango ikom deyo ma imiyo bota? Pien in ingeya, an ma abedo laticini. <verse eid="1CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19" />Pira keken, ai Rwot, dok pi cwinyi giri keni, omiyo itiyo gin madito magi ducu, me miyo gin madito ducu ma kit man ongene. <verse eid="1CH 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20" />Pe tye ngat mo macalo in, ai Rwot, dok pe tye Lubanga mo, kono in keken, kit mayam wawinyo ki itwani. <verse eid="1CH 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21" />Rok mene ma wi lobo marom ki joni jo Icrael, mayam Lubanga ocito kakokogi wek gubed jone, wek nyingi oywek pirgi, pi tiyo gin madito mamiyo ki dano lworo, ki pi ryemo rok mapol kacel ki lubangagi ki inyim lwaki, mayam in ikokogi ki i Ejipt? <verse eid="1CH 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22" />In ityeko miyo lwaki jo Icrael gudoko joni nakanaka; dok in, ai Rwot, yam idoko Lubangagi.<verse eid="1CH 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23" />Ai Rwot Lubanga, kombedi dong imok lok meri mayam iwaco ikoma ki ikom jo ma i oda matwal, ci dong i tim kit ma ityeko waconi. <verse eid="1CH 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24" />Mok lok ma iwaconi, wek nyingi obed me adwora nakanaka kun giwaco ni, ‘Rwot Lubanga me mony, Lubanga pa Icrael, en aye Lubanga maloyo Icrael.’ Ci ot pa latici Daudi bimoko inyimi matwal. <verse eid="1CH 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25" />Pien in, Lubanga, ityeko nyutu bota ni ibimiyo oda bedo madit; ma omiyo an latici alimo tekcwiny me kelo lega man inyimi. <verse eid="1CH 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26" />Ai Rwot, in aye Lubanga, ci in dong ityeko cike me timo gin man maber pira. <verse eid="1CH 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27" />Pimeno, mi gum ikom dano ma i oda ki yomcwiny, wek gumede ameda kibedo inyimi nakanaka; pien ngat ma in imiye gum, gume bedo nakanaka, ai Rwot.”<verse eid="1CH 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi oloyo lweny mapol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 8:1-18">2 Cam 8:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1" />Lacen Daudi dok otayo jo Piliciti, oloyogi, ci omayo taun madit me Gat ki gangi matino ma ingete ki i cing jo Piliciti. <verse eid="1CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2" />Daudi dok otayo jo Moab, ci jo Moab gudoko lutice, kun giculu mucoro bote.<verse eid="1CH 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3" />Daudi dok otayo Adadejer rwot me Joba, ma tung Kamat, mayam omito mayo dog kulu me Euprate. <verse eid="1CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4" />Ci Daudi omako gadigadi lwenye alip acel, ki wegi aguragura alip abiro, ki acikari ma giwoto ki tyen gi alip pyere aryo ongolo odon tyen aguraguragi ducu mayam giywayo gadigadi lwenygi, ento oweko mogo manok odong maromo ywayo gadigadi miya acel.<verse eid="1CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5" />Ka jo Ciria me Damaciko gubino kakonyo kor Adadejer rwot me Joba, ci Daudi oneko jo Ciria alip pyere aryo wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6" />Daudi oketo lumony i cel gogo i lobo Ciria ma ite loc me Damaciko; ci jo Ciria gudoko lutic pa Daudi, kun giculu mucoro bote. Rwot Lubanga obedo kamiyo tek me bwoyo lobo bot Daudi kama yam ocito iye ducu. <verse eid="1CH 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7" />Daudi yam oyako lwak kwot me jabu ki bot jo pa Adadejer ci otingogi, ci oterogi i Jerucalem. <verse eid="1CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:40-47">1 Luk 7:40-47</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:11-18">2 Tek 4:11-18</ref></char></note>Daudi oyako lwak mola mapol ki i taun madito magi, Tibat ki Kun, ma onongo yam Adadejer loyogi. Man aye nyonyo bronze mayam Solomon oyubu kwede lagwok pii madit me nyonyo bronze, ki wir, ki agulu me mola.<verse eid="1CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9" />Ka rwot Tou me Kamat owinyo ni Daudi otyeko tayo mony pa Adadejer woko ducu liweng, <verse eid="1CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10" />ci ocwalo wode Adoram bot rwot Daudi ka mote, ki pi pwoyo en pi lweny ikom Adadejer ki me loyo en woko; pien yam Adadejer obedo kalweny ki Tou tyen mapol. Dok ocwalo lwak jami mapol me jabu, ki me ryal ki me mola bene. <verse eid="1CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11" />Jami magi ducu rwot Daudi yam odyerogi pi woro Rwot. Daudi odyerogi kacel ki ryal ki jabu mayam oyakogi ki bot jo Edom, jo Moab, jo Ammon, jo Piliciti ki jo Amalek.<verse eid="1CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12" />Dok Abicai wod pa Jeruya oneko jo Edom alip apar wiye aboro i nota me Kado. <verse eid="1CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13" />Ci oketo lumony i cel gogo me Edom; ma oweko jo Edom ducu gudoko lutic pa Daudi. Rwot omiyo Daudi obwoyo lobo kama yam ocito iye ducu.<verse eid="1CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14" />Daudi oloyo jo Icrael ducu kitmeno; en obedo kangolo kop atir dok kakare ikom lwake ducu. <verse eid="1CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15" />Joab wod pa Jeruya obedo ladit me mony; ki Yekocapat wod pa Akilud obedo laco lok ma time; <verse eid="1CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16" />Jadok wod pa Akitub ki Akimelek wod pa Abiatar gubedo ajwaki pa Lubanga; Cavica obedo karan, <verse eid="1CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17" />ki Benaya wod pa Yekoyada obedo ladit maloyo jo Keret ki jo Pelet; ki awobe pa Daudi gubedo ludito maloyo tic pa rwot.<verse eid="1CH 18:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi oloyo jo Ammon ki jo Ciria</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 10:1-19">2 Cam 10:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1" />Ka man otum, Nakac rwot pa jo Ammon oto woko, ci wode oleyo katyene. <verse eid="1CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2" />Daudi owaco ni, “Abinyutu cwiny me mar bot Kanun wod pa Nakac, kit mayam wone onyutu cwiny me mar botani.” Ma omiyo Daudi ocwalo lukwena bote kakweyo cwinye pi to pa wone. Ci ka lutic pa Daudi guo bot Kanun i lobo pa jo Ammon kakweyo cwinye. <verse eid="1CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3" />Ento rwodi pa jo Ammon guwaco bot Kanun ni, “In itamo ni Daudi ocwalo lukwe cwinyi pi keto deyo ikom woru? Daudi mono pe ocwalo lutice kangiyo piny, ki katuru gang, ki pi roto lobo ducu?” <verse eid="1CH 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4" />Kitmeno omiyo Kanun omako lutic pa Daudi, ci olyelo yer tikgi, ka dok ongolo dye bongogi tung pyergi, ka ocwalogi kwede woko; ci gucito. <verse eid="1CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5" />Ka kitito bot Daudi pi jo meno, ci ocwalo dano ka jologi, pien onongo gitye ki lewic madwong tutwal. Ci rwot Daudi owaco ni, “Kong wubed i Jeriko, nio ka yer tikwu otwi olot, ka dong wudwog kany.”<verse eid="1CH 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6" />Ka jo Ammon guneno ni pirgi odoko ngwe marac bot Daudi, ci Kanun ki jo Ammon gucwalo ryal maromo talanta alip acel me pango gadigadi lweny ki wegi aguragura ki bot jo Mecopotamia, wa ki i lobo Arammaaka, ki i Joba. <verse eid="1CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7" />Ci gupango gadigadi lweny alip pyere adek wiye aryo. Rwot me Maaka bene, obino ki monye, ci ogony inyim Medeba. Jo Ammon gucoke ki i gangigi, gubino kalweny. <verse eid="1CH 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8" />Ka Daudi owinyo pirgi, ci ocwalo Joab kacel ki mony pa twoni oteka lweny ducu. <verse eid="1CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9" />Ci Jo Ammon gubino gurwayo cok ka guryeyo i dog cel me taun madit; ki luker ma gubino guryeyo ken gi, i dye bar.<verse eid="1CH 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10" />Ka Joab oneno mony okace woko ryoryo, tung nyime ki tung ngeye bene, ci oyero jo Icrael ma oyita lweny, ocako ryeyogi gukemo jo Ciria; <verse eid="1CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11" />ci oketo jo mudonge bot omine Abicai, gin bene guryeyo gukemo jo Ammon. <verse eid="1CH 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12" />Joab owaco ni, “Kace jo Ciria gubedo tek ikoma, ci i bikonya, ento ka jo Ammon aye gubedo tek ikomi, an abikonyi. <verse eid="1CH 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13" />Bed oteka ma cwinye nwang, wek walweny pi lutuwa, ki pi taun madito pa Lubangawa, Rwot bene otim gin ma oneno ni ber.” <verse eid="1CH 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14" />Kitmeno Joab ki jo ma gitye kwede ducu gurwayo cok ka lweny ikom jo Ciria; ci jo Ciria guringo woko ki inyime. <verse eid="1CH 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15" />Ka jo Ammon guneno jo Ciria guringo woko, ci gin bene gucako ringo woko ki inyim Abicai omin Joab, gudonyo wa i taun madit. Ci Joab odok i Jerucalem.<verse eid="1CH 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16" />Ento ka jo Ciria guneno jo Icrael guloyogi, gucwalo lukwena ci gukelo jo Ciria ma gitye loka kulu Euprate, kacel ki Copak ma lawimony pa Adadejer ma latel wigi. <verse eid="1CH 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17" />Ka kitito pirgi bot Daudi, ci en bene ocoko jo Icrael ducu ongolo kwedgi kulu Jordan, ci obino ikomgi, oryeyo monye orwayo ikomgi. Ka Daudi dong oryeyo monye, ci orwayo kom jo Ciria, gucako lweny kwede. <verse eid="1CH 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18" />Jo Ciria gucako ringo woko ki inyim Icrael. Daudi oneko jo Ciria ma giringo ki gadigadi lweny alip abiro, ki acikari ma giwoto ki tyen gi alip pyere angwen, ka dok oneko Copak ladit me monygi woko bene. <verse eid="1CH 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19" />Ka lutic pa Adadejer guneno ni jo Icrael dong gutyeko loyogi woko, ci guketo lok kuc obedo ikin gi ki Daudi, ci gudoko lutice. Kitmeno jo Ciria pe dok gubedo ki miti me konyo jo Ammon ikare mo keken.<verse eid="1CH 19:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi omako Raba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 12:26-31">2 Cam 12:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 11:1">2 Cam 11:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>I dog oro ma en aye kare ma luker cito kwede kamony, Joab ocako telo wi mony, ci opoto mony ikom jo Ammon, ka dok gucito gurumu Raba. Ento Daudi odong i Jerucalem. Joab olwenyo matek ikom Raba, ci oloyogi. <verse eid="1CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2" />Ci Daudi okwanyo lalukana me jabu ki iwi cal jok pa jo Ammon, ma peke onongo cok romo kilo 34 ma got me wel bene onongo tye iye. Ci Daudi okwanyo got me wel meno oketo ikom lalukanane. Ka dok okelo lwak jami ma kiyako ki i taun madit meno i Jerucalem. <verse eid="1CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3" />Dok okelo jo ma kimakogi ki i taun madit meno, ci oketogi katic ki mucumeno ki cururu nyonyo ki latong. Daudi obedo katimo jo ma i taun pa jo Ammon ducu kitmeno. Ci Daudi ki lwak ducu gucako dok cen wa i Jerucalem.<verse eid="1CH 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo pa Daudi guneko oteka lweny</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 21:18-22">2 Cam 21:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4" />Lacen lweny dok ocake ikom jo Piliciti ma i Gejer; ci Cibekai ma Lakucat oneko Cipai woko, ma onongo en ngat acel ma ikin likwayo pa twon olumani. Ci yam gin oloyo jo Piliciti kitmeno. <verse eid="1CH 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:4-7">1 Cam 17:4-7</ref></char></note>Ka lweny dok ocake ikom jo Piliciti; ci Elkanan wod pa Jair oneko Lami ma omin Goliac ma jo Gat, mayam bol tonge rom ki rii yat lacwe bongo. <verse eid="1CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6" />Lweny dok obedo i Gat kama tye iye dano mo ma opute mabor liwau, matye ki nyig cinge abicel, ki nyig tyene bene abicel, tung ryoryo ducu, ci nyig lwet cinge ki tyene ducu romo pyere aryo wiye angwen. En bene yam lakwar twoni olumanu. <verse eid="1CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7" />Ka en okati kanywaro jo Icrael ki ngala, ci Yonacan wod pa Cimea ma omin Daudi oneko en woko. <verse eid="1CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8" />Jo man gin likwayo pa twoni oluma ma i Gat; gin ducu Daudi kacel ki lutice gutyekogi woko.<verse eid="1CH 20:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi okwano wel jo Icrael ki Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 24:1-25">2 Cam 24:1-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1" />Catan ocung kalweny ikom Icrael, ci ocako piyo Daudi pi kwano wel jo Icrael. <verse eid="1CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2" />Kitmeno Daudi owaco bot Joab ki ludito me mony ducu ni, “Wucit kakwano wel jo Icrael, cake ki i Beer-ceba nio kwede wa i Dan, ci wudwok loke ducu bota, wek ange welgi.” <verse eid="1CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3" />Ento Joab ojuku Daudi kun wace ni, “Myero Rwot Lubanga aye omed wel lwaki tyen miya kulu, kit ma dong gidwong kwedeni! Pe gin ducu lwaki ce rwoda rwot, gin ducu lutici, rwoda. Ci pingo i mito timo lakit tim macalo man? Pingo i mito ni ikelo bal ikom Icrael?” <verse eid="1CH 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4" />Ento lok pa Daudi obedo tek makato pa Joab. Omiyo Joab oa ocito orumu lobo Icrael ducu, ka odwogo kwede cen wa i Jerucalem. <verse eid="1CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5" />Ka Joab ocako miyo wel lwak ma en okwanoni bot Daudi. Jo Icrael ducu onongo giromo milion acel ki alip miya acel ma gin wegi pala lucwan, ki i Juda giromo alip miya angwen ki pyere abiro ma gin wegi pala lucwan. <verse eid="1CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6" />Ento Joab pe okwano wel jo pa Levi ki pa Benjamin, pien onongo cwiny Joab dag cik pa rwot.<verse eid="1CH 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7" />Ento cwiny Lubanga pe obedo yom ikom lok meno; ci ocako neko jo Icrael. <verse eid="1CH 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8" />Ci Daudi ocako bako doge bot Lubanga kun waco ni, “Abalo twon bal mo madit pi gin ma dong atyeko tiyone. Kombedi dong alegi, i kwany roc pa latici woko; pien atimo lok man me mingo tutwal.” <verse eid="1CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9" />Ci Rwot oloko ki Gad, ma lanen pa Daudi, kun wace ni, <verse eid="1CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10" />“Cit i wac bot Daudi ni, ‘Rwot owaco kuman ni, amiini lok adek; in i kwany acel ki ikin gi, wek amii opot ikomi.’” <verse eid="1CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11" />Kitmeno Gad obino bot Daudi ci otite lok meno ni, “Rwot owaco kuman ni ‘Kwany acel ma i mitone! <verse eid="1CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12" />I mito kec opot pi mwaka adek; nyo lumerokwu oryemwu pi dwe adek, kun ginekowu ki pala lucwan; nyo pala pa Rwot aye opot i loboni ki two gemo pi nino adek kulu, kun lamalaika pa Rwot neko jo ma i lobo Icrael tyeko woko ducu?’ In dong i tam kit lok ma abidok kwede bot Rwot ma ocwala botini.” <verse eid="1CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13" />Ci Daudi owaco bot Gad ni, “An dong adonyo i twon can madit ma pe wace. Wek apot icing Rwot, pien kicane dwong; ento pe apot icing dano.”<verse eid="1CH 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14" />Kitmeno Rwot owalo two gemo opoto ikom Icrael; ci jo Icrael guto maromo co alip pyere abiro. <verse eid="1CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15" />Ci Lubanga ocwalo lamalaika ikom Jerucalem pi tyekone woko; ento ka dong mito tyekone, ci Rwot oneno, ci ongut ikom gin ma rac man, ci ojuku lamalaika ma lanek pinyi woko, kun wace ni, “Man dong oromo, dong igik nek woko.” Man otime inget laro moyo pa Ornan ma jo Jebuc. <verse eid="1CH 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16" />Ka Daudi oilo wange malo ci oneno lamalaika pa Rwot ocung ikin lobo ki polo, kun owoto pala lucwan otingo ikom Jerucalem. Ci Daudi ki ludongo ducu, gucako ruku bongo cola, gupoto kwede piny aryeba cwiny.<verse eid="1CH 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17" />Ci Daudi owaco bot Lubanga ni, “Pe an aye yam aciko pi kwano wel lwak? An aye yam abalo atyeko tiyo roc madit tutwal, ento lwak romi man, gutimo kit roc ango? Alegi ni, wek cingi opot ikoma ki ikom ot pa kwara keken; pe iwek two gemo opot wa ikom lwaki.”<verse eid="1CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18" />Lamalaika pa Rwot dok ociko Gad ni owac ki Daudi wek ocit kacano keno tyer pi Rwot i laro moyo pa Ornan ma jo Jebuc. <verse eid="1CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19" />Daudi ocito kunu pi lok pa Gad, ma onongo oloko kit ma Rwot ocike kwede. <verse eid="1CH 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20" />Ikare meno onongo Ornan tye ka dino ngano; ka oloke oneno lamalaika, ci en ki awobene angwen mayam gitye kwede gukane woko. <verse eid="1CH 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21" />Ka Daudi woto cito bot Ornan, ci Ornan oneno; ka oneno Daudi ci oa ki i laro ocito bot Daudi, omiye woro kun oryebe piny inyime. <verse eid="1CH 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22" />Ci Daudi owaco bot Ornan ni, “Miya kabedo man me laro moyo wek acan iye keno tyer pi Rwot, miya awil pi wele kikome, wek two gemo okee woko ki ikom lwak.” <verse eid="1CH 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23" />Ci Ornan owaco bot Daudi ni, “Ber i ter; wek in, rwoda rwot, i tyer iye gin ma i neno ni ber; nen amiyo twon me gitum awanga, ki opam ladin ngano me yen, ki nyig ngano me gityer me moko kwon; amiyogi ducu.” <verse eid="1CH 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24" />Ento rwot Daudi ogamo dog Ornan ni, “Pe kumeno, ento abiwilo i wele kikome; pe abityero jamini ma pe mera bot Rwot, pe abimiyo gitum awanga ma pe awilo ki lima.” <verse eid="1CH 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25" />Kitmeno Daudi ocako miyo bot Ornan cekel me jabu miya abicel ma kipimo pekgi pi wilo kabedonu. <verse eid="1CH 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26" />Ci Daudi ocako cano keno tyer pi Rwot kunu, ka otyero gitum awanga ki gitum me berbedo. Daudi oworo iye Rwot, ci Rwot odok iye ki mac ma oa i polo ma obino ikom keno tyer me gitum awanga. <verse eid="1CH 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27" />Rwot ociko lamalaika, ci orwako pala lucwane i akurane. <verse eid="1CH 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28" />Ikare meno, ka Daudi oneno ni Rwot otyeko doke iye ki i laro moyo pa Ornan ma jo Jebuc, ci obedo katyero gitume ducu kunu. <verse eid="1CH 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29" />Pien kema pa Rwot ma Moses yam otiyo i tim, ki keno tyer me gitum awanga bene onongo pud gitye wa i kabedo me woro Lubanga iwi got matye Gibeon. <verse eid="1CH 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30" />Ento Daudi yam pe cito kunu kapenyo dog Rwot Lubanga, pien obedo kalworo pala lucwan pa lamalaika pa Rwot.<verse eid="1CH 21:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1" />Daudi dok owaci, “Ot pa Rwot Lubanga bibedo kany, ki keno tyer me gitum awanga pi jo Icrael bene bibedo kany.”<verse eid="1CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi oyubu pi gero Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2" />Daudi ociko ni kigur lurok ma gibedo i lobo Icrael, ci oketogi i tic me payo godi. Gupayo godi mabeco pi gero Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3" />Daudi dok okano lwak nyonyo madwong me yubu cumar pi guru kika me dog gang, ki okol latwe bao, ki lwak mola madwong ma peke pe pime, <verse eid="1CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4" />ki lwak bao cedar ma wele pe kwane, pien jo Cidon ki jo Turo gukelo bot Daudi bao cedar madwong tutwal. <verse eid="1CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5" />Pien Daudi yam owaco ni, “Latina Solomon pud tidi, peya tye ki ngec mo, dok Ot ma kibigero pi Rwot myero obed me deyo makato ducu, wek ywekane ki deyone orom lobo ducu; ma omiyo an aye omyero ayub kit me gerone.” Pieno Daudi ocako yubu lwak jami madwong tutwal ma pud kwo.<verse eid="1CH 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6" />Ka dok olwongo wode Solomon, ci ociko en pi gero Ot pa Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael. <verse eid="1CH 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2 Cam 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1 Tek 17:1-14</ref></char></note>Daudi owaco ki Solomon ni, “Woda, onongo abedo ki tam i cwinya pi gero ot mo pi woro nying Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8" />Ento lok pa Rwot yam oloko bota kun waci, ‘In dong ityeko oyo lwak remo mapol, dok ibedo kalwenyo lweny maditogu mapol; ci in pe i bigero ot mo pi woro an, pien ityeko oyo lwak remo madwong inyima ki iwi lobo. <verse eid="1CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9" />Nen ba, in i binywalo latin laco; en bibedo ki kuc, abimiye kuc ma lumeroke ducu pe gibiyele; pieno nyinge bibedo Solomon, dok abimiyo kuc ki yweyo bot Icrael ikarene. <verse eid="1CH 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10" />En aye bigero ot pi woro an. En bibedo woda, ki an abibedo wone, dok abimoko komkere bedo i Icrael matwal.’ <verse eid="1CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11" />Eyo latina, Rwot obed kwedi, wek ityek gero Ot pa Rwot Lubangani, kit mayam oloko kwede ikomini. <verse eid="1CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12" />Atikane, Rwot aye myero omiyi ryeko ki niang matut, wek ibed kalubu cik pa Rwot Lubangani ka en bene dong omiyi dit me loyo Icrael. <verse eid="1CH 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:6-9">Yoc 1:6-9</ref></char></note>Dok i bilimo gum kace ibedo kagwoko kit cik ducu ki ngol kop ducu ma ceng Rwot ociko ki Moses pi jo Icrael. Dong bed oteka ma cwinyi nwang. Pe ilwor, cwinyi pe opoti. <verse eid="1CH 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14" />Nen an dong ayele mada ci dong bene atyeko yubu jami magi pi Ot pa Rwot: jabu maromo talanta alip miya acel, ryal maromo talanta milion acel, ki mola ki nyonyo ma peke pe pime, pien gidwong tutwal; ka dok ayubu bao ki got bene. In dok imed mukene ikomgi. <verse eid="1CH 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15" />Dok itye ki lwak lutic mapol. Lupaa godi, lugedo ki godi, lupac ki ludiro tic ducu ma welgi pe kwane, ki jo ma gitye makwiri i ticgi, <verse eid="1CH 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16" />ma gitiyo tic ki jabu, ki ryalgu, ki mola ki nyonyogu. Dong ia malo icak tic cut! Rwot aye obed kwedi.”<verse eid="1CH 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17" />Daudi dok ociko ludito ma i Icrael ducu pi konyo wode Solomon kun waco botgi ni, <verse eid="1CH 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18" />“Rwot Lubanga pe tye kwedwu? Dok pe en aye omiyo ki wun kuc i kabedowu ducu? Dok en aye otyeko miyo wegi loboni icinga omiyo aloyogi; dok jo me lobo man bene dong kitayo ki inyim Rwot wa ki inyim lwake. <verse eid="1CH 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19" />Eyo, kombedi dong wuket cwinywu ki tamwu kayenyo Rwot Lubangawu. Dong wutware malo wucit wunu kagero Kabedo Maleng pa Rwot Lubanga, ka wek Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot ki jami maleng ducu pa Lubanga kikelgi wa i Ot ma dong kigero pi woro nying Rwot.”<verse eid="1CH 22:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 1:1-40">1 Luk 1:1-40</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka Daudi dong otii ma mwakane dong dwong, ci ocako keto wode Solomon wek obedo rwot maloyo Icrael.<verse eid="1CH 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tic pa Lulevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2" />Rwot Daudi dok ocoko ludito ma i Icrael ducu kacel ki ajwaki ki Lulevi bene. <verse eid="1CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3" />En omiyo kikwano wel Lulevi ducu ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere adek dok kwede malo, ci wel co ducu oromo alip pyere adek wiye aboro. <verse eid="1CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4" />Daudi owaco ni, “Jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen ki ikomgi kibiketogi katic i Ot pa Rwot; jo alip abicel gibibedo jaggi ma giloyo Ot pa Lubanga ki lungolkop; <verse eid="1CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5" />jo alip angwen gibibedo lugwok dogola, ki jo alip angwen gibipako Rwot ki jami wer mayam atiyo pi pako Rwot.” <verse eid="1CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6" />Ci Daudi opokogi i dul adek muporo awobe pa Levi: Gercom, Kokat ki Merari.<verse eid="1CH 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7" />Lutino awobe pa Gercom gin aye Ladan ki Cimei. <verse eid="1CH 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8" />Lutino awobe pa Ladan gin aye Jekiel ma laditgi, ki Jetam ki Joel, gin adek. <verse eid="1CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9" />Lutino awobe pa Cimei gin aye Celomot, Kajiel ki Karan, gin adek. Magi gin aye ludito kaka pa Ladan ma i odi pa kwarogi. <verse eid="1CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10" />Lutino awobe pa Cimei gin aye Jakat, Jina, Jeuc ki Beria. Jo angwen nu gin aye lutino awobe pa Cimei. <verse eid="1CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11" />Jakat aye onongo laditgi, ki me aryone Jija; ento Jeuc ki Beria pe gunywalo awobe mapol, ma omiyo kikwanogi macalo dog ot ma kwarogi acel.<verse eid="1CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12" />Lutino awobe pa Kokat gin aye Amram, Ijar, Kebron ki Ujiel, gin angwen. <verse eid="1CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Nia 28:1</ref></char></note>Lutino awobe pa Amram gin aye Aron ki Moses. Aron kidyere me tic pi kwero jami maleng makato, wek en ki lutino awobene guwang odok eceta inyim Rwot matwal, dok guti bote, gulam gum i nyinge matwal. <verse eid="1CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14" />Ento lutino awobe pa Moses, ma dano pa Lubanga, yam ki kwanogi ikin kaka pa Levi. <verse eid="1CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15" />Lutino awobe pa Moses gin aye Gercom ki Eliejer. <verse eid="1CH 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16" />Lutino awobe pa Gercom: Cebuel aye laditgi. <verse eid="1CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17" />Lutino awobe pa Eliejer: Rekabia aye laditgi. Eliejer pe onywalo lutino awobe mukene, ento Rekabia onywalo lutino awobe mapol mada. <verse eid="1CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18" />Lutino awobe pa Ijar, Celomit aye laditgi. <verse eid="1CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19" />Lutino awobe pa Kebron gin aye Jeria ma laditgi, ki me aryone Amaria, me adeke Jakajiel, ki me angwene Jekameam. <verse eid="1CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20" />Lutino awobe pa Ujiel gin aye Mika ma laditgi, ki me aryone Icia.<verse eid="1CH 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21" />Lutino awobe pa Merari gin aye Makali ki Muci. Lutino awobe pa Makali gin aye Eleajar ki Kic, <verse eid="1CH 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22" />Eleajar oto ma pe onywalo awobe, onywalo anyira keken; ento ludogolagi ma awobe pa Kic aye gunyomogi. <verse eid="1CH 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23" />Lutino awobe pa Muci gin aye Makali, Eder ki Jeremot, gin adek.<verse eid="1CH 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24" />Magi aye lutino awobe pa Levi ma i odi pa kwarogi, ma gin ludito kaka ma i odi pa kwarogi kit mayam ki coyogi kwede, ma lubu wel ki nying dano ki acel acel ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere aryo dok kwede malo, ma gibedo katiyo tic i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25" />Pien Daudi onongo owaco ni, “Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael dong omiyo kuc ki jone; ki en bene bibedo i Jerucalem matwal. <verse eid="1CH 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:8">Nwo 10:8</ref></char></note> Pimeno Lulevi pe dong bimite me tingo kema pa Rwot, kadi jami mo ma kitiyo kwede.” <verse eid="1CH 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27" />Pi lok ma Daudi oloko me agikine omiyo kicoyo wel Lulevi ma ditogi romo mwaka pyere aryo ci odok kwede malo. <verse eid="1CH 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-9">Wel 3:5-9</ref></char></note>En dok owaco ni, “Ticgi bibedo me konyo awobe pa Aron katic i Ot pa Rwot, kun gigwoko dyekal ki kicika odi matinone, gibilonyo jami maleng ducu, dok gibitiyo kit tic mukene ducu ma i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29" />Dok gibikonyo bene me gwoko mugati ma kiketo inyim Rwot, ki moko kwon me gityer me moko kwon, ki capat ma repe ma tobi pe iye, ki gityer me moko kwon ma kitedo i otako nyonyo, ki gityer me moko kwon ma kirubu ki moo, ki me pimo pek ki dwong me gityer mapatpat me Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30" />Gin gibicung kamiyo pwoc ki pak bot Rwot jwijwi i odiko ki otyeno kitmeno, <verse eid="1CH 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31" />ki ikare ducu ma gityero gitum awanga bot Rwot i ceng Cabit, ki i Por Dwe, ki inino maditogu, gibicung inyim Rwot kare ducu, kun gilubu wel jo ma kiciko. <verse eid="1CH 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32" />Gibigwoko Kema me Rwate ki Kabedo Maleng kitmeno, dok gibikonyo utmegigi, awobe pa Aron, i ticgi ma i Ot pa Rwot.”<verse eid="1CH 23:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Tic pa Ajwaki pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1" />Dul pa likwayo pa Aron gin ene. Lutino awobe pa Aron gin aye Nadab, Abiu, Eleajar ki Itamar. <verse eid="1CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Lev 10:1-2</ref></char></note>Ento Nadab ki Abiu guto woko ikare ma won gi pud kwo, lutinogi bene obedo peke, ma omiyo Eleajar ki Itamar gudoko ajwaki pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3" />Ci Daudi opokogi muporo dog ticgi ma kiyerogi iye, kun jo ma konyogi gin aye Jadok matye ikin likwayo pa Eleajar, ki Akimelek ma ikin likwayo pa Itamar. <verse eid="1CH 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4" />Dong kit macalo kinongo jo madito mapol ikin likwayo pa Eleajar makato ma ikin likwayo pa Itamar, gupoko ludito kaka ma i dog odi pa kwarogi apar wiye abicel pi likwayo pa Eleajar, ki ludito kaka ma i odi pa kwarogi aboro pi likwayo pa Itamar. <verse eid="1CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5" />Kipokogi ki bolo kwir, marom, pien ludito me Kabedo Maleng ki ludito pa Lubanga yam gubedo ikin likwayo pa Eleajar ki ikin likwayo pa Itamar bene. <verse eid="1CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6" />Cemaya wod pa Netanel ma Lalevi, ma obedo karan, yam ocoyo nyinggi ki inyim rwot, ki inyim rwodi, ki ajwaka Jadok, ki Akimelek wod pa Abiatar, ki ludito kaka ma i odi pa kwari pa ajwaki ki pa Lulevi; yam guyero dog ot pa kwarogi acel pi Eleajar ki acel kiyero pi Itamar.<verse eid="1CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7" />Kwir mukwongo opoto ikom Yekoyarib, ki me aryo ikom Jedaya, <verse eid="1CH 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8" />me adek ikom Karim, me angwen ikom Ceorim, <verse eid="1CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9" />me abic ikom Malkija, me abicel ikom Mijamin, <verse eid="1CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10" />me abiro ikom Kakoj, me aboro ikom Abija, <verse eid="1CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11" />me abongwen ikom Yecwa, me apar ikom Cekania, <verse eid="1CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12" />me apar wiye acel ikom Eliacib, me apar wiye aryo ikom Jakim, <verse eid="1CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13" />me apar wiye adek ikom Kupa, me apar wiye angwen ikom Jecebeab, <verse eid="1CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14" />me apar wiye abic ikom Bilga, me apar wiye abicel ikom Imer, <verse eid="1CH 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15" />me apar wiye abiro ikom Kejir, me apar wiye aboro ikom Kapijej, <verse eid="1CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16" />me apar wiye abongwen ikom Petakia, me pyere aryo ikom Jekejikel, <verse eid="1CH 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17" />me pyere aryo wiye acel ikom Jakin, me pyere aryo wiye aryo ikom Gamul, <verse eid="1CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18" />me pyere aryo wiye adek ikom Delaya, me pyere aryo wiye angwen ikom Maajia. <verse eid="1CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19" />Dog tic ma kiyero jo magi iye obedo me donyo i Ot pa Rwot, kun gilubu cik mayam kwarogi Aron oketo pirgi, macalo Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael yam ociko en kwede.<verse eid="1CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20" />Man obedo lok ikom likwayo pa Levi mudonge: ikin likwayo pa Amram kiyero Cubael; ki ikin likwayo pa Cubael kiyero Jedeya. <verse eid="1CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21" />Likwayo pa Rekabia: ikin likwayo pa Rekabia kiyero Icia ma laditgi. <verse eid="1CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22" />Ikin likwayo pa Ijar kiyero Celamot; ikin likwayo pa Celamot kiyero Jakat. <verse eid="1CH 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23" />Ikin likwayo pa Kebron kiyero Jeria ma laditgi, me aryone Amajia, me adek Jakajiel, me angwen Jekameam. <verse eid="1CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24" />Ikin likwayo pa Ujiel kiyero Mika; ikin likwayo pa Mika kiyero Camir, <verse eid="1CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25" />Omin Mika en aye Icia; ikin likwayo pa Icia kiyero Jekaria. <verse eid="1CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26" />Ikin likwayo pa Merari kiyero Makali ki Muci. Ikin likwayo pa Jajia kiyero Beno. <verse eid="1CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27" />Likwayo pa Merari gin aye Jajia, Beno, Cokam, Jakur ki Ibri. <verse eid="1CH 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28" />Ikin likwayo pa Makali kiyero Eleajar ma pe onywalo awobe. <verse eid="1CH 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29" />Ikin likwayo pa Kic kiyero Jeramel. <verse eid="1CH 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30" />Ikin likwayo pa Muci kiyero Makali, Eder ki Jerimot. Magi gin aye likwayo pa jo Levi, kun lubu dog odi pa kwarigi. <verse eid="1CH 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31" />Jo magi bene ma ludito kaka ma i dog odi pa kwarigi acel acel gubolo kwir, kun ladit bolo kacel ki utmegine ma tino, macalo utmegigi ma likwayo pa Aron gubolo ki inyim rwot Daudi, Jadok, Akimelek ki ludito kaka ma i dog odi pa kwari pa ajwaki ki pa Lulevi.<verse eid="1CH 24:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25" />
  <para style="s1">Luwer me Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1" />Daudi ki ludito maloyo tic guyero me miyo tic me telo woro bot jo mogo ma ikin likwayo pa Acap, pa Eman ki pa Jedutun, wek gutit lok pa Lubanga macalo lunebi ki gugo opuk ki nanga ki atego agoyagu. Nying jo mayam gitiyo tic man, ki dog ticgi gin ene: <verse eid="1CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2" />ikin lutino pa Acap, Jakur, Yucepu, Netania ki Acarela, ma lutino pa Acap, Acap aye telogi i wer, kun tito lok ma a ki bot Lubanga, ite cik pa rwot. <verse eid="1CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3" />Lutino pa Jedutun gin Gedalia, Jeri, Jecaya, Cimei, Kacabia ki Matitia, gin abicel, ma won gi Jedutun aye telogi i wer, kun tito lok ma a ki bot Lubanga kun goyo opuk pi miyo pwoc bot Rwot. <verse eid="1CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4" />Lutino pa Eman gin Bukia, Matania, Ujiel, Cebuel, ki Jerimot, Anania, Kanani, Eliata, Gidalti, ki Romamtiejer, Jocebekaca, Maloti, Kotir ki Makajiot. <verse eid="1CH 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5" />Magi ducu aye lutino pa Eman ma lanen pa rwot, macalo Lubanga yam ociko bote ni ebipilo wiye; pien Lubanga omiyo ki Eman lutino awobe apar wiye angwen ki anyira adek. <verse eid="1CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6" />Gin ducu yam won gi aye telogi i wer i Ot pa Rwot, kun giwero ki atego agoya, nanga ki opuk pi konyo lega ma i Ot pa Lubanga. Acap, Jedutun ki Eman yam gitiyo ite loc pa rwot Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7" />Wel jo man kiribo ki utmegigi mayam gipwonyogi pi wer bot Rwot, jo ducu mayam luryeko onongo giromo miya aryo ki pyere aboro wiye aboro. <verse eid="1CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8" />Gin ducu kipokogi i dog tic kun gibolo kwir, kun jo matino ki jo madito, lupwony ki jo ma gipwonyogi, gitimogi ducu ma romrom.<verse eid="1CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9" />Kwir mukwongo opoto ikom Yucepu, ma jo pa Acap; me aryone opoto ikom Gedalia, ci okwako en ki omegine, ki lutino awobene, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10" />Me adeke opoto ikom Jakur kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11" />Me angwene opoto ikom Ijri kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12" />Me abice opoto ikom Netania kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13" />Me abicele opoto ikom Bukia kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14" />Me abirone opoto ikom Jecarela kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15" />Me aborone opoto ikom Jecaya kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16" />Me abongwene opoto ikom Matania kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17" />Me apare opoto ikom Cimei kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18" />Me apar wiye acele opoto ikom Ajarel kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19" />Me apar wiye aryone opoto ikom Kacabia kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20" />Me apar wiye adeke opoto ikom Cubael kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21" />Me apar wiye angwene opoto ikom Matitia kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo <verse eid="1CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22" />Me apar wiye abice opoto ikom Jeremot kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23" />Me apar wiye abicele opoto ikom Anania kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24" />Me apar wiye abirone opoto ikom Jocebekaca kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25" />Me apar wiye aborone opoto ikom Kanani kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26" />Me apar wiye abongwene opoto ikom Maloti kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27" />Me pyere aryone opoto ikom Eliata kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28" />Me pyere aryo wiye acele opoto ikom Kotir kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29" />Me pyere aryo wiye aryone opoto ikom Gidalti kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30" />Me pyere aryo wiye adeke opoto ikom Makajiot kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31" />Me pyere aryo wiye angwene opoto ikom Romamtiejer kacel ki lutino awobene ki omegine, gin ducu apar wiye aryo.<verse eid="1CH 25:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26" />
  <para style="s1">Lugwok dogola me Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1" />Magi aye tic ma kimiyo ki dul pa lugwok dogola me Ot pa Lubanga ma gin lulevi. Ikin jo pa Kora guyero Mecelemia ma wod pa Kore matye ikin likwayo pa Acap. <verse eid="1CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2" />Mecelemia onywalo awobe magi: Jekaria ma latin kayone, ka dok me aryone Jediael, me adeke Jebadia, me angwene Jatiniel, <verse eid="1CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3" />me abice Elam, me abicele Yekokanan, me abirone Eliekoenai. <verse eid="1CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:11">2 Cam 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:14">1 Tek 13:14</ref></char></note>Obed-edom onywalo awobe magi: Cemaya ma latin kayo, ka dok me aryone Yekojabad, me adeke Joa, me angwene Cakar, me abice Netanel, <verse eid="1CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5" />me abicele Amiel, me abirone Icakar, me aborone Peuletai; pien Lubanga omiye gum. <verse eid="1CH 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6" />Ki wode Cemaya bene onywalo awobe ma gubedo rwodi i dog odi pa kwarogi, pien gubedo jo makwiri atika. <verse eid="1CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7" />Lutino awobe pa Cemaya gin aye Otini, Repael, Obed ki Eljabad, ma omegigi gubedo jo makwiri, nyinggi Eliu ki Cemakia. <verse eid="1CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8" />Jo magi ducu gin aye likwayo pa Obed-edom kacel ki awobegi ki omegigi, jo makwiri ma giromo tic ki ikin jo me ot pa Obed-edom giromo pyere abicel wiye aryo. <verse eid="1CH 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9" />Mecelemia bene obedo ki awobene ki omegine ma gikwiri, gin apar wiye aboro. <verse eid="1CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10" />Ki Koca ma ikin likwayo pa Merari onywalo awobe magi: Cimri aye obedo laditgi; kadi pe en aye latin kayo, ento wone oketo en odoko ladit; <verse eid="1CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11" />ka dok me aryone Ilkia, me adeke Tebalia, me angwene Jekaria; awobe pa Koca kacel ki omegine, ducu giromo apar wiye adek.<verse eid="1CH 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12" />Lugwok dogola kipokogi i dul malube ki dogola gi, ma dul acel acel tye ki ladite, ci kipoko ki gin tic, kit mayam kipoko ki utmegigi bene ma gubedo katic i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="1CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13" />Ci dok kibolo kwir ma lubu dog odi pa kwarogi, pi nongo dogola ma gibigwoko, kun dog odi matino ki maditone gitimogi marom. <verse eid="1CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14" />Kwir ma kibolo pi dogola ma tung kunyango opoto ikom Celemia. Gibolo kwir bene pi wode Jekaria, ma en lamitam ma ngeyo piny mada, ci kwire opoto pi dogola ma tung kumalo. <verse eid="1CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15" />Pa Obed-edom opoto pi dogola ma tung kupiny, ci pa awobene obedo pi ot kano jami. <verse eid="1CH 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16" />Pa Cupim ki Koca opoto pi dogola ma tung kupotoceng, kacel ki dogola ma kilwongo ni Caleket ma i yoo ma dok tung kumalo. Lugwok dogola gukeme ki luwotgi. <verse eid="1CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17" />Ki tung kunyango gubedo jo abicel inino acel acel, ki tung kumalo jo angwen inino acel acel, ki tung kupiny bene jo angwen inino acel acel, kacel ki jo aryoaryo i ot kano jami. <verse eid="1CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18" />I ot ma tere aperu ma tung kupotoceng onongo kiketo jo angwen inget yoo, ki aryo inget ot ma tere aperu. <verse eid="1CH 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19" />Magi aye dul pa lugwok dogola ma ikin jo pa Kora ki likwayo pa Merari.<verse eid="1CH 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ludito ma gwoko odi me kano lim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20" />Ikin Lulevi giketo Akija obedo ladit ma gwoko odi me kano lim ma i Ot pa Lubanga, ki odi me kano lim me mot ma kidyero bot Rwot. <verse eid="1CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21" />Ikin likwayo pa Gercon likwayo pa Ladan aye gubedo ludito kaka i dog odi pa kwarogi. Laditgi aye Jekieli.<verse eid="1CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22" />Lutino awobe pa Jekieli, ma gin aye Jetam ki omine Joel, gubedo ludito ma gwoko odi me kano lim ma i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="1CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23" />Ikin jo pa Amram, pa Ijar, pa Kebron ki pa Ujiel, <verse eid="1CH 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24" />Cebuel, ma lakwar Gercom ma wod pa Moses, en aye rwot madit ma giketo pi gwoko odi me kano lim. <verse eid="1CH 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25" />Omegine gin ene: ikin likwayo pa Eliejer obedo wode Rekabia, ma wode Jecaya, ma wode Joram, ma wode Jikri, ma wode Celomot.<verse eid="1CH 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26" />Celomot ki omegine gubedo ludito ma gwoko odi me kano mot ducu mayam rwot Daudi odyero bot Rwot, ki mot ma ludito kaka ma i odi pa kwarogi ki ludito ma giloyo buca mony me jo alip, ki buca mony me jo miya, ki lutela wi mony yam gudyero bene. <verse eid="1CH 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27" />Gin yam gudyero mot ma oa ki i lim ma kiyako i lweny ci gudyero me tic i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28" />Dok bene lim ducu mayam Camuel ma lanenpiny, ki Caulo wod pa Kic, ki Abneri wod pa Ner, ki Joab, wod pa Jeruya yam gudyero bot Rwot; mot ducu ma gidyero Celomot ki omegine gubedo ka gwokone.<verse eid="1CH 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ludito tic mukene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29" />Ikom jo pa Ijar, kiketo Kanania ki awobene pi tic ma woko ma i Icrael me bedo jagi ki lungolkop. <verse eid="1CH 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30" />Ikom jo pa Kebron kiketo Kacabia ki omegine ma gikwiri maromo alip acel ki miya abiro me neno tic ma i Icrael ma loka Jordan tung kupotoceng, pi tic pa Lubanga ki pi tic pa rwot Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31" />Ikom jo pa Kebron laditgi obedo Jerija maloyo jo pa Kebron ducu ma ocoko dog odi pa kwarogi ducu. I mwaka me pyere angwen me loc pa Daudi yam kibedo kayenyo jo ma kwiri, ci gunongo jo ma kwiri atika ma ikin gi i Jajer ma i Gilead. <verse eid="1CH 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32" />Rwot Daudi oketo en ki omegine, jo ma kwiri maromo alip aryo ki miya abiro, ma gin ludito kaka ma i odi pa kwarogi, me neno tic pa jo pa Reuben, jo pa Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace pi lok ducu ma mako tic pa Lubanga ki pi lok pa rwot Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27" />
  <para style="s1">Ludito mony ma loyo tic pa rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1" />Man aye nying jo Icrael ma ludito kaka ma i odi pa kwarogi, ludito ma giloyo buca mony pa jo alip ki buca mony pa jo miya, ki luditogi mayam gitiyo bot rwot ikom lok ducu ma mako dul pa jo ma gibino ki ma gicito katic kun gitiyo dwe ki dwe pi mwaka ducu, kun dul acel acel wele romo jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2" />Jacobeam ma wod pa Jabdiel en aye ladit maloyo dul mukwongo ma tiyo i dwe mukwongo; i dulle tye iye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3" />En yam lakwar Perej, dok obedo ladit maloyo luwi mony ducu pa mony ma gitiyo i dwe mukwongo. <verse eid="1CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4" />Dodai ma jo Akoki aye ladit maloyo jo ma tiyo i dwe me aryo ki lakony kore obedo Miklot; i dule tye iye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5" />Ladit me adeke, maloyo jo ma tiyo i dwe me adek, en aye Benaya wod pa ajwaka Yekoyada, en aye laditgi; i dule tye iye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6" />Benaya mayam obedo twon oteka ikin jo pyere adek ca, dok bene en aye ma onongo loyo jo pyere adek ku. Wode Amijabad aye ladit maloyo lwak ma i dule. <verse eid="1CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7" />Me angwene obedo Acael ma omin Joab, pi dwe me angwen; ngat ma olube obedo Jebadia ma wode. I dule tye iye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8" />Ladit me abice, pi dwe me abic, en aye Camkut ma jo pa Ijra; i dule tye iye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9" />Me abicele pi dwe me abicel en aye Ira ma wod pa Ikec ma jo Tekoa; i dule tye iye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10" />Me abirone, pi dwe me abiro, en aye Kelej ma jo Pelon, ma ikin likwayo pa Epraim; i dule tye iye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11" />Me aborone, pi dwe me aboro, en aye Cibekai ma jo Kueat, pa jo pa Jera; i dule tye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12" />Me abongwene, pi dwe me abongwen, en aye Abiejer ma jo Anatot, ma Labenjamin; i dule tye iye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13" />Me apare, pi dwe me apar, en aye Makarai ma jo Netopa, ma jo Jera; i dule tye iye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14" />Me apar wiye acele, pi dwe me apar wiye acel, en aye Benaya ma jo Piraton, ma ikin likwayo pa Epraim; i dule tye i iye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen. <verse eid="1CH 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15" />Me apar wiye aryone, pi dwe me apar wiye aryo, en aye Keldai ma jo Netopa, likwayo pa Otiniel; i dule tye iye jo alip pyere aryo wiye angwen.<verse eid="1CH 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludito maloyo wi kaka pa jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16" />Jo maloyo kaka pa Icrael gin ene: ladit maloyo jo pa Reuben en aye Eliejer ma wod, pa Jikri; pi jo pa Cimeon, Cepatia ma wod pa Maaka; <verse eid="1CH 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17" />pi jo pa Levi, en Kacabia ma wod pa Kamuel; pi jo pa Aron, Jadok; <verse eid="1CH 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18" />pi jo pa Juda, Eliu, ma ngat acel ma ikin omegi Daudi; pi jo pa Icakar, Omri ma wod pa Mikael; <verse eid="1CH 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19" />pi jo pa Jabulon, Icmaya ma wod pa Obadia; pi jo pa Naputali, Jeremot ma wod pa Ajriel; <verse eid="1CH 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20" />pi jo pa Epraim, Kocea ma wod pa Ajajia; pi nucu kaka pa Manace, Joel ma wod pa Pedaya; <verse eid="1CH 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21" />pi nucu kaka pa Manace ma i Gilead, Iddo ma wod pa Jekaria; pi jo pa Benjamin, Jaciel ma wod pa Abneri; <verse eid="1CH 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22" />pi jo pa Dan, Ajarel ma wod pa Jerokam. Magi aye ludito maloyo kaka ducu ma i Icrael.<verse eid="1CH 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:5">Aca 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:4">26:4</ref></char>
    </note>Daudi yam pe okwano wel jo ma mwaka me ditogi pe romo pyere aryo, pien Rwot yam ociko ni ebimiyo jo Icrael gibedo mapol macalo lwak lakalatwe me polo. <verse eid="1CH 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:1-15">2 Cam 24:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 21:1-14">1 Tek 21:1-14</ref></char></note>Joab ma wod pa Jeruya yam ocako kwano welgi ento pe ocobo; kadi bed kumeno akemo opoto ikom Icrael pi roc man, welgi bene pe kicoyo i buk me tekwaro pa rwot Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukan lim pa rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25" />Ngat maloyo odi me kano lim pa rwot en aye Ajimavet ma wod pa Adiel; ki maloyo odi lim ma i lobo, ma i taun ki gangi madito ki matinone, ki i odi lubele ma ocudu malo likung en aye Yonacan ma wod pa Ujia; <verse eid="1CH 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26" />ki maloyo jo ma gitiyo tic me pur i poto en aye Ejiri ma wod pa Kelub; <verse eid="1CH 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27" />ki maloyo poto olok en aye Cimei ma jo Rama; ki maloyo gin ma ocek i poto olok ma kikano i odi me kano kongo bwino en aye Jabdi ma jo Cipmi. <verse eid="1CH 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28" />Ngat maloyo yadi jeituni ki olam ma i bar Cepela en aye Baal-kanan ma jo Geder, dok ngat maloyo ot kano moo jeituni en aye Yoaci. <verse eid="1CH 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29" />Ngat maloyo lwak dyangi ma kikwayogi i Caron aye Citrai ma jo Caron; ki maloyo lwak dyangi ma i nota ducu aye Capat ma wod pa Adlai. <verse eid="1CH 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30" />Ngat maloyo kinaga aye Obil ma jo Icmael, ki maloyo megi kana aye Jedeya ma jo Meronot. Ngat maloyo romi ki dyegi aye Jajij ma jo Agri. <verse eid="1CH 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31" />Jo magi ducu gin lugwok lim pa rwot Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lumiitam bot rwot Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32" />Yonacan ma okeyo Daudi aye lamitam, pien obedo dano ma niang matut, dok karan bene; en ki Jekiel ma wod pa Kakmoni gubedo lugwok lutino awobe pa rwot. <verse eid="1CH 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33" />Akitopel obedo lamitam pa rwot, ki Kucai ma jo Arki obedo larem rwot. <verse eid="1CH 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34" />Jo ma guleyo katyen Akitopel aye Yekoyada ma wod pa Benaya, ki Abiatar. Joab aye ladit me mony pa rwot.<verse eid="1CH 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28" />
  <para style="s1">Daudi ociko pi gero Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1" />Daudi ocoko ludito pa jo Icrael ducu i Jerucalem, ludito maloyo kaka ducu, ludito maloyo dul tic ducu ma gitiyo ite loc pa rwot, ludito maloyo buca mony me jo alip, ki buca mony me jo miya, ludito ma gwoko jami ducu, kacel ki lim makwo ducu, pa rwot ki pa awobene, kacel ki ludito maloyo gangkal, ki jo ma gin twoni oteka, ki jo ducu ma gunyebe ki lweny. <verse eid="1CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2 Cam 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1 Tek 17:1-14</ref></char></note>Ci rwot Daudi oa malo, ocung, ocako waco ni, “Wuwiny an, wun utmega ki wun lwaka. Yam abedo ki tam i cwinya me gero ot kama Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot biywe iye, ki kama kibiketo iye kom pa Lubanga me teno tyene; ci abedo kayubu kit me gerone ducu. <verse eid="1CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3" />Ento Lubanga ojuka kun waco ki an ni, ‘In pe i bigero ot mo pi woro nyinga, pien in lalweny, dok ityeko oyo lwak remo madwong.’ <verse eid="1CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4" />Kadi bed kumeno, ci Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael yam oyero an ki ikin dogola pa kwarina ducu me bedo rwot maloyo jo Icrael matwal; pien yam oyero Juda wek obed ladit, ki i ot pa Juda en oyero ot pa wora, ki ikin lutino awobe pa wora cwinye okwanyo an me bedo rwot maloyo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="1CH 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5" />Ikom lutino awobena ducu, macalo Lubanga omiya lutino awobe mapol, en oyero iye woda Solomon me bedo iwi komker ma ite ker pa Rwot maloyo Icrael. <verse eid="1CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6" />Ci Lubanga owaca ni, ‘Wodi Solomon aye bigera Ot ki dye kale ducu, pien ayero en wek obed woda, ki an bene abibedo wone. <verse eid="1CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7" />Abimoko kere bedo matwal, dong kace cwinye bimoko matek me lubu cika ki lok ma angolo ducu, kit ma en tye kalubu ikare man.’ <verse eid="1CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8" />Dong acikowu inyim jo Icrael ducu, ki inyim lwak pa Rwot ducu, ma kun nongo Lubanga bene winyo, ni wun wubed kagwoko ki kayenyo cik pa Rwot Lubangawu kare ducu, wek wubed wegi lobo man maberi, ci wek lobo man obed ginaleyawu matwal kadi wa bot likwayowu ma gibilubu ngewu.<verse eid="1CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9" />In woda Solomon bene, ber inge Lubanga pa wora, ci itii ki en ki cwinyi ducu ki kero komi ducu; pien Rwot ngiyo cwiny dano ducu, dok ngeyo gin ma cwiny dano yubu ducu ki kit tame ducu. Kace ibiyenyo en, ci in ibinongo kome; ento kace ibwoto en woko, ci en bene bitenyi woko matwal. <verse eid="1CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10" />Ber i gwoke matek, pien Rwot dong otyeko yero in pi gero Ot me Kabedo Maleng; bed oteka, wek i tim gin ducu ma omyero i tim.”<verse eid="1CH 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11" />Ci Daudi omiyo bot wode Solomon cal ma kigoyo pi Ot pa Lubanga mayam kigoyo, ki cal odine ducu, ki cal odi kano lim, ki me kicika mamalo ducu, ki me kicika odi matino ducu ma i iye, ki me kicika ma kom me kica bedo iye. <verse eid="1CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12" />Dok omiye cal ma nyutu dyekal me Ot pa Rwot ducu kit mayam cwinye otamo, ki kicika odi matino ma orumu ot ducu, ki odi me kano lim ducu ma i Ot pa Lubanga, ki odi me kano lim me mot ma kidyero bot Rwot. <verse eid="1CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13" />Ci onyute bene dul tic pa ajwaki ki Lulevi, ki kit kwayi tic ducu ma gitiyo i Ot pa Rwot; ki kit kwayi jami ducu ma gitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="1CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14" />Daudi onyutu kit mapek pa jabu ma mite pi jami me jabu ma i dog tic acel acel, ki pek pa jami me ryal pi dog tic acel acel, <verse eid="1CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15" />ki pek pa lacib mac me jabu, ki mac laputgi, pek me jabu ma mite pi lacib mac acel acel ki lwak lapute ducu, ki pek pa ryal ma mite pi lacib mac acel acel ki lwak lapute ducu, muporo kit tic pa lacib mac acel acel ma kitiyo kwede, <verse eid="1CH 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16" />ki pek me jabu ma mite pi meja acel acel me mugati me aketa inyim Rwot, ki pek me ryal ma mite pi tiyo meja me ryal ducu, <verse eid="1CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17" />ki jabu ma kiliyo mabere pi gin lacob ringo, ki becen ducu, ki kikopo ducu; dok pi atabo jabu ducu, ki pekgi acel acel; pi atabo ryal ducu ki pekgi acel acel. <verse eid="1CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18" />Daudi bene onyutu kit ma keno tyer me wango odok eceta ma kitiyo ki jabu ma kiliyo malenge, ki kit ma peke myero obed kwede. Ka dok onyute cal gadigadi me jabu pa lukerubi ma giyaro bwomgi me umu Canduk me Gicike pa Rwot. <verse eid="1CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19" />Man ducu en onyutu kamaleng pi gin mayam Rwot ocoyo pire ki cinge. Tice ducu myero ki tii ma lubu kit cal meno.<verse eid="1CH 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20" />Daudi dok owaco bot wode Solomon ni, “Bed laco ma cwinyi nwang, wek i tim tic magi ducu. Pe ilwor, pe cwinyi bene oryange: pien Rwot Lubanga, ma en aye Lubangana, tye kwedi. En pe bibwoti ata, dok pe bitenyi ata, nio ka tic ducu ma kibitiyo i Ot pa Rwot bitum. <verse eid="1CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21" />Nen, i tye ki lwak dul pa ajwaki ki pa Lulevi pi tiyo tic ducu me Ot pa Lubanga ki jo ducu ma ludiro i kwayi tic ducu, ma gitye ki miti, gin gibinywako tic kwedi; ki dok ludito ki lwak ducu gibiwinyo dogi i lok ducu.”<verse eid="1CH 28:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29" />
  <para style="s1">Mic ma kimiyo me gero Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 22:5">1 Tek 22:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot Daudi dok owaco bot lwak ducu ma gucoke ni, “Latina Solomon Lubanga gire aye ma oyero, en pud tidi, peya tye ki ngec mo, dok tice bene dit; pien gangkal man pe bibedo pa dano ento pa Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2" />Pieno dong atyeko yubu jami ducu pi Ot pa Lubangana kit ma atwero, jabu pi jami me jabu, ryal pi jami me ryal, mola pi jami me mola, nyonyo pi jami me nyonyo, bao pi jami me bao, kun amedo iye lwak kidi onik mapol mada, ki lutino kidi me amwona ikom jabu, ki akuku gu, ki godi ma rangigi tye patpat, godi me wel ma kitgi patpat, ki kidi matar bene. <verse eid="1CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3" />Dok pien cwinya obedo yom ikom Ot pa Lubangana, omiyo amiyo jami magi me jabu ki me ryal ma oa ki icinga pi Ot pa Lubangana, kun amedo ikom lwak jami ducu ma atyeko yubu pi Ot maleng. <verse eid="1CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4" />Amiyo jabu ma peke romo talanta adek, en aye jabu me Opir, ki ryal ma kiliyo maleng ma peke romo talanta alip abiro pi mwono kom Ot pa Rwot, <verse eid="1CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5" />ki pi tic ducu ma ludiro bitiyo; jabu pi jami me jabu, ki ryal pi jami me ryal. Kombedi dong koni anga mono ma bikelo jami ma cwinye opwoyoni, ma tin dok dyere kene inyim Rwot?”<verse eid="1CH 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6" />Ci ludito kaka ma i odi pa kwarigi gucako tyero mot ma igi opwoyo, ki ludito maloyo kaka bene gumiyo kitmeno, ki ludito maloyo buca mony me jo alip ki buca mony me jo miya, ki ludito maloyo tic pa rwot. <verse eid="1CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7" />Ci gumiyo jami magi pi tic me Ot pa Lubanga: jabu maromo talanta alip abic ki darik alip apar, ki ryal maromo talanta alip apar, ki mola maromo talanta alip aboro, ki nyonyo maromo talanta alip miya acel. <verse eid="1CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8" />Jo matye ki godi me wel gumiyogi i ot kano lim ma i Ot pa Rwot, ma Jekiel ma jo pa Gercon aye gwoko. <verse eid="1CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9" />Cwiny lwak obedo yom pien lutelagi gumiyo mot ki cwinygi ducu bot Rwot Lubanga. Rwot Daudi bene cwinye obedo yom matek.<verse eid="1CH 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daudi opako Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10" />Mumiyo Daudi opako Rwot inyim lwak mucoke ducu, kun waco ni, “Kipak in Rwot Lubanga pa kwariwa Icrael, nino ma pe tum. <verse eid="1CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:13">Mat 6:13</ref></char></note>Ai Rwot, dit ki tek ki deyo ki loc ki woro ducu meri, pien jami ducu matye i polo ki matye i lobo ducu meri. Ker bene meri, ai Rwot, in kipilo wii pien i loyo jami ducu. <verse eid="1CH 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12" />Lonyo ki deyo ducu a ki boti, dok in aye i loyogi ducu. Twero ki tek ducu tye icingi, dok cingi aye miyo ki dano dit, dok miyo tek ki jo ducu. <verse eid="1CH 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13" />Wan dong wapwoyi, in Lubangawa, kun wapako nyingi me deyo matek.<verse eid="1CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14" />Ento an anga, ki lwaka kono gin ango, ma omiyo wabedo ki twero kit man me miyo jamiwa kit ma iwa opwoyoni? Pien jami ducu a ki boti, dok wadwoki giri. <verse eid="1CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15" />Pien wan wawelo inyimi, ki lubedo, kit mayam kwariwa tye kwede; ninowa me kwo i lobo ni bene bedo loke calo tipu, ki genwa i kabedowa ni dong pe pien pe watwero kane iye ki bot to. <verse eid="1CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16" />Ai Rwot Lubangawa, lwak jami man ducu ma wamiyo pi gero ot pi nyingi maleng gua ki i cingi, dok gin ducu jamini giri. <verse eid="1CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17" />An angeyo, ai Lubangana ni, in i temo cwiny dano, dok i pwoyo dano ma cwinye atir; pi cwinya matye atir, omiya atyero boti mot me jami magi ducu; dong atyeko neno lwaki ki wanga, gin ma gitye kanyi, ka gityero jamigi boti kit ma cwinygi omito ki yomcwiny madwong. <verse eid="1CH 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18" />Ai Rwot Lubanga pa kwariwa Abraim ki Icaka ki Icrael, mii cwiny lwaki okem tam ma kit meno nakanaka, dok imii cwinygi okem boti keken. <verse eid="1CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19" />Dok i mii bot woda Solomon gum me mako ciki ki cwinye ducu, ki lok ducu ma i cikogu, kun en cobogi ducu; kun i miye gum me gero Otti ma dong atyeko yubu jami pireni.”<verse eid="1CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20" />Lacen Daudi owaco bot lwak ducu mucoke ni, “Wupwo Rwot Lubangawu.” Lwak mucoke ducu gucako pwoyo Rwot Lubanga pa kwarigi, ci gukulu wigi piny, guworo Rwot, dok gumiyo woro bot rwot Daudi bene. <verse eid="1CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21" />Orwone gutyero gitum awanga bot Rwot, twoni alip acel, nyogi romi alip acel ki lutino romi alip acel, kacel ki gityer amata ma otiko kit gityer acel acel, ki kit lwak gitum mukene mapol pi jo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="1CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22" />Ci gucamo dok gumato inyim Rwot inino meno ki yomcwiny madwong tutwal.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 29:22">Ci guketo Solomon wod pa Daudi me bedo rwot tyen me aryone, kun kiwire ki moo me bedo laker pi Rwot, dok kiwiro Jadok bene me bedo ajwaka pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:12">1 Luk 2:12</ref></char></note>Lacen Solomon obedo rwot iwi komker pa Rwot ma ka wone Daudi; ci obedo ki gumkom, kun jo Icrael giworo doge. <verse eid="1CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24" />Ci ludito ducu ki twoni oteka lweny ducu, kacel ki lutino awobe pa rwot Daudi ducu, gucike pi woro rwot Solomon. <verse eid="1CH 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25" />Ci Lubanga omiyo Solomon yweka madit inyim jo Icrael ducu, ci ocako onyo deyo me loc ikome madwong makato mayam pe onen ikom rwot mo keken me Icrael nia wa con.<verse eid="1CH 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ladol lok ikom loc pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26" />Daudi wod pa Yece yam oloyo Icrael ducu kitmeno. <verse eid="1CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">2 Cam 5:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:4">1 Tek 3:4</ref></char></note>En oloyo jo Icrael pi mwaka pyere angwen kulu; obedo kaloc i Kebron pi mwaka abiro, ka dok i Jerucalem pi mwaka pyere adek wiye adek. <verse eid="1CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28" />Daudi oto ma dong otii woko likong, ikare maber mupong ki lonyo ki deyo; ci wode Solomon aye oleyo katyene. <verse eid="1CH 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29" />Lok kom rwot Daudi ducu nia i acakine nio i agikine kicoyogi i buk me Tekwaro pa Camuel ma lanen ki i buk me Tekwaro pa lanebi Natan, ki i buk me Tekwaro pa Gad ma lanen, <verse eid="1CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30" />kacel ki lok kom loce ducu, ki teke ducu, ki lok ducu ma otime ikome, ki ikom Icrael ki ikom ker ducu ma i lobo.<verse eid="1CH 29:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29" />
</usx>